(559868, 57078, 7252, '<td valign="top">I had a very similar idea for a photo for this challenge. It was to be titled, "Pisces, Pan Fried with Lemon and Balsamic Vinegar". I was planning on frying them so they had a little curve to them and laying them out on the plate in the shape of the pisces sign. However, I never really got into a seafood mood. But back to your photo. I like what you''ve done. It could use a little more light on the right side of the nearest fish. A small gold reflector would add a nice warm light. I like the rope. Not something I would have thought of but it really leads the eye around in a whimsical manner and keeps the image from being too static. Very nice overall.</td>', 'I had a very similar idea for a photo for this challenge. It was to be titled, "Pisces, Pan Fried with Lemon and Balsamic Vinegar". I was planning on frying them so they had a little curve to them and laying them out on the plate in the shape of the pisces sign. However, I never really got into a seafood mood. But back to your photo. I like what you''ve done. It could use a little more light on the right side of the nearest fish. A small gold reflector would add a nice warm light. I like the rope. Not something I would have thought of but it really leads the eye around in a whimsical manner and keeps the image from being too static. Very nice overall.', '2004-01-28 01:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
