(559974, 57279, 4967, '<td valign="top">is that cellophane?  hehehe... he''s the water bearer but not the water pourer.... Aquarias is an air sign.  Interesting photo  though...</td>', 'is that cellophane?  hehehe... he''s the water bearer but not the water pourer.... Aquarias is an air sign.  Interesting photo  though...', '2004-01-28 02:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(559981, 57218, 13336, '<td valign="top">That is amazing.  And its not JUST a neat effect - you have some very nice, dramatic lighting and interesting backdrop.  Overall, the concept and execution is great.  A couple of specs and what looks like oversharpening keep this from getting a 10 from me, though.  A solid 9 for sure.</td>', 'That is amazing.  And its not JUST a neat effect - you have some very nice, dramatic lighting and interesting backdrop.  Overall, the concept and execution is great.  A couple of specs and what looks like oversharpening keep this from getting a 10 from me, though.  A solid 9 for sure.', '2004-01-28 02:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(559982, 56668, 11316, '<td valign="top">Would''ve preferred it without the shadow on the black king, other than that I like it ;)</td>', 'Would''ve preferred it without the shadow on the black king, other than that I like it ;)', '2004-01-28 02:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
