(559986, 57251, 13336, '<td valign="top">nice use of soft focus and backlighting.  the negative space is a little unbalanced to me - either put her more to the left or keep her in the center i think.  lovely model.</td>', 'nice use of soft focus and backlighting.  the negative space is a little unbalanced to me - either put her more to the left or keep her in the center i think.  lovely model.', '2004-01-28 02:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
