(560156, 56988, 12194, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, the frame adds to the picture a lot - it brings up the color. Although  I would apply less sharpening - it almost seems that on the grass the filter brush strokes was applied. But it''s still a very nice pic! 7</td>', 'Nice photo, the frame adds to the picture a lot - it brings up the color. Although  I would apply less sharpening - it almost seems that on the grass the filter brush strokes was applied. But it''s still a very nice pic! 7', '2004-01-28 06:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
