(560473, 57284, 13759, '<td valign="top">Oh, it´s so cute! Very nice kities. Take cats shoots is an art. There are some things that I learn, about it. They need to be maked up, put some pieces of tape and brush. The scenary is good. The light must allow you to use higher shutter speeds. They move vary fast when you put a camera in fromt of. You has a bit of blur from both motion and shallow DOF. Increase the DOF and shutter speed.</td>', 'Oh, it´s so cute! Very nice kities. Take cats shoots is an art. There are some things that I learn, about it. They need to be maked up, put some pieces of tape and brush. The scenary is good. The light must allow you to use higher shutter speeds. They move vary fast when you put a camera in fromt of. You has a bit of blur from both motion and shallow DOF. Increase the DOF and shutter speed.', '2004-01-28 11:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
