(560548, 56847, 4967, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, however Aquarius is actually an air sign... not a water sign, although it is the water bearer... kind of weird how that is but true.  I like the abstractedness in your photo, with the black branches ot the tree showing through very interesting.</td>', 'Interesting photo, however Aquarius is actually an air sign... not a water sign, although it is the water bearer... kind of weird how that is but true.  I like the abstractedness in your photo, with the black branches ot the tree showing through very interesting.', '2004-01-28 11:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(560549, 57094, 4967, '<td valign="top">Aquarius is actually an air sign not a water sign, although it is the water bearer.  Interesting photo... looks like bubbles, very abstract.</td>', 'Aquarius is actually an air sign not a water sign, although it is the water bearer.  Interesting photo... looks like bubbles, very abstract.', '2004-01-28 11:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(560550, 57029, 13759, '<td valign="top">Good composition. I had noticed that many people has tryed to shoot dark scenes like yours. But they has a lot of issues about focus. May be you had tryed to do it with the AF. The AF don´t works well with low light situation. If you don´t has MF capabilities, try to show normal light conditions then do a brightness adjust in PS.</td>', 'Good composition. I had noticed that many people has tryed to shoot dark scenes like yours. But they has a lot of issues about focus. May be you had tryed to do it with the AF. The AF don´t works well with low light situation. If you don´t has MF capabilities, try to show normal light conditions then do a brightness adjust in PS.', '2004-01-28 11:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(560551, 57265, 4967, '<td valign="top">This looks like a lobster not a crab?  I like the photo though... although I would have liked to have seen a little more definition to the ice underneath, especially on the left side.</td>', 'This looks like a lobster not a crab?  I like the photo though... although I would have liked to have seen a little more definition to the ice underneath, especially on the left side.', '2004-01-28 11:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
