(560556, 56641, 4967, '<td valign="top">Aquarius is actually an air sign not a water sign, although it is the water bearer.  Weird but true... interesting photo, I like the blueness of it and the composition.</td>', 'Aquarius is actually an air sign not a water sign, although it is the water bearer.  Weird but true... interesting photo, I like the blueness of it and the composition.', '2004-01-28 11:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(560557, 57223, 4967, '<td valign="top">Actually Aquarius is an air sign not a water sign.  Although it is the water bearer, it''s still an air sign.  Interesting photo though... I reeally like it.  I think It would hae been even better with a closer crop....</td>', 'Actually Aquarius is an air sign not a water sign.  Although it is the water bearer, it''s still an air sign.  Interesting photo though... I reeally like it.  I think It would hae been even better with a closer crop....', '2004-01-28 11:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
