(560563, 57047, 16438, '<td valign="top">has a powerful feel to the image... I like images that make me feel</td>', 'has a powerful feel to the image... I like images that make me feel', '2004-01-28 11:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(560564, 57198, 13759, '<td valign="top">In almost all aquarium shoots in this challenge are easy to see a focus lack. This is caused by the low light conditions. You need to compensate it in some way (more light, speedlight, apperture) to avoid the motion blur. The subject itself moves very fast and you need to focus as quick as it move. A workaround to do it is choose infinity focus mode.</td>', 'In almost all aquarium shoots in this challenge are easy to see a focus lack. This is caused by the low light conditions. You need to compensate it in some way (more light, speedlight, apperture) to avoid the motion blur. The subject itself moves very fast and you need to focus as quick as it move. A workaround to do it is choose infinity focus mode.', '2004-01-28 11:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(560566, 56554, 13891, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, but found the bottom right corner distracting,</td>', 'I like this shot, but found the bottom right corner distracting,', '2004-01-28 11:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(560568, 56828, 13759, '<td valign="top">Wow! Man, what is the size of your lens! This is amazing. Incredible sharp and clear. Yeah, a bit more and you can shoot Mars to NASA!:) You´re blessad by your lens. Good shoot.</td>', 'Wow! Man, what is the size of your lens! This is amazing. Incredible sharp and clear. Yeah, a bit more and you can shoot Mars to NASA!:) You´re blessad by your lens. Good shoot.', '2004-01-28 11:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(560573, 57159, 3942, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait with a felicitous models expression. Composition and cropping are well done, IMHO there ist nothing serious, you could have done better. Maybe I would have left out the watch, IMHO it competes against the nose ring.  But that''s only marginal...  Good luck for the challenge!</td>', 'Nice portrait with a felicitous models expression. Composition and cropping are well done, IMHO there ist nothing serious, you could have done better. Maybe I would have left out the watch, IMHO it competes against the nose ring.  But that''s only marginal...  Good luck for the challenge!', '2004-01-28 11:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(560577, 57181, 13759, '<td valign="top">Yeah, good try. But this need to be sharp. The flash reflect so much in its eyes, given a strange look. But talk seriously, why cats has with lions?</td>', 'Yeah, good try. But this need to be sharp. The flash reflect so much in its eyes, given a strange look. But talk seriously, why cats has with lions?', '2004-01-28 11:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
