(560656, 56668, 8488, '<td valign="top">In almost any other competition, this would get a *great* score from me, because the focus, composition, contrast, and, well, *everything* are great. However, it doesn''t seem to have anything to do with the zodiac (either of them), so I have to grade it way down in this particular competition. :-/ Beautiful image, though.</td>', 'In almost any other competition, this would get a *great* score from me, because the focus, composition, contrast, and, well, *everything* are great. However, it doesn''t seem to have anything to do with the zodiac (either of them), so I have to grade it way down in this particular competition. :-/ Beautiful image, though.', '2004-01-28 12:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
