(560729, 57150, 10047, '<td valign="top">The contrast seems a little harsh and makes the shadow on the arm and leg a little distracting. I might have put the subject off center instread of square in the photo.</td>', 'The contrast seems a little harsh and makes the shadow on the arm and leg a little distracting. I might have put the subject off center instread of square in the photo.', '2004-01-28 13:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(560734, 56428, 10047, '<td valign="top">Too bad about the photo being so small. I think it has potential, but its difficult to tell. The katydid also seems too centered in the photo. I might have tried cropping it to one side or the other.</td>', 'Too bad about the photo being so small. I think it has potential, but its difficult to tell. The katydid also seems too centered in the photo. I might have tried cropping it to one side or the other.', '2004-01-28 13:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(560739, 57095, 13025, '<td valign="top">Nice and clean Sign!</td>', 'Nice and clean Sign!', '2004-01-28 13:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(560741, 56784, 13025, '<td valign="top">Excellent Sign and Execution!</td>', 'Excellent Sign and Execution!', '2004-01-28 13:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(560743, 57178, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  You may have been going fro the grainy/slightly blurred look, but I think it''s over the top.  A slightly more focussed or sharper image would have been better.  The treatment given to the image does not do justice to the presumably beautiful long hair.  A second weaker light coming in from the left would have given more body to the hair as well.  I like the crop and the concept is sound.</td>', 'Nice idea.  You may have been going fro the grainy/slightly blurred look, but I think it''s over the top.  A slightly more focussed or sharper image would have been better.  The treatment given to the image does not do justice to the presumably beautiful long hair.  A second weaker light coming in from the left would have given more body to the hair as well.  I like the crop and the concept is sound.', '2004-01-28 13:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(560744, 57087, 10047, '<td valign="top">My feelings exactly. I might have tried more contrast and saturation, but thats just me.</td>', 'My feelings exactly. I might have tried more contrast and saturation, but thats just me.', '2004-01-28 13:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(560747, 57297, 13025, '<td valign="top">Good idea and humorous execution.</td>', 'Good idea and humorous execution.', '2004-01-28 13:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(560749, 57265, 10047, '<td valign="top">Looks more like a lobster than a crab, but they''re all shellfish. I might have tried a tighter crop on the eyes. The top of the head seems out of focus.</td>', 'Looks more like a lobster than a crab, but they''re all shellfish. I might have tried a tighter crop on the eyes. The top of the head seems out of focus.', '2004-01-28 13:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(560751, 57218, 13025, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and execution!</td>', 'Nice idea and execution!', '2004-01-28 13:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(560753, 57165, 11738, '<td valign="top">The lion is too centered and way too bright when considering the surroundings.  A tighter crop showing only the lion''s bust might have better suited, drawing attentio to the statue and reducing he wandering efect caused by the surrounding area.  This is a good example where a black and white treatment could have worked wonders.  Sharpness is bang on.  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'The lion is too centered and way too bright when considering the surroundings.  A tighter crop showing only the lion''s bust might have better suited, drawing attentio to the statue and reducing he wandering efect caused by the surrounding area.  This is a good example where a black and white treatment could have worked wonders.  Sharpness is bang on.  Keep up the good work.', '2004-01-28 13:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(560754, 57208, 11738, '<td valign="top">Don''t understand what''s going on with the white line on the left edge.  Border gone wrong?</td>', 'Don''t understand what''s going on with the white line on the left edge.  Border gone wrong?', '2004-01-28 13:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(560755, 57031, 6668, '<td valign="top">seems very out of focus to me.</td>', 'seems very out of focus to me.', '2004-01-28 13:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(560757, 57029, 11738, '<td valign="top">Too bad you had to crop the arrow point.  Very nice idea.  Lighting is good but I find too dark in the left lower corner.  The overall image could have been lightened just a tad, even considering your title.</td>', 'Too bad you had to crop the arrow point.  Very nice idea.  Lighting is good but I find too dark in the left lower corner.  The overall image could have been lightened just a tad, even considering your title.', '2004-01-28 13:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(560761, 57218, 11738, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea!  Your title bugs me though since you seem to be referring to Cupid, and not Sagitarrius.  Too bad about those two spots on the wall, but I understand that classical rules were in place for this shot.  Too bad that the "arrow light" is so high on her face.  I would have preferred it at chin level or a little lower.  Love the background colour</td>', 'Excellent idea!  Your title bugs me though since you seem to be referring to Cupid, and not Sagitarrius.  Too bad about those two spots on the wall, but I understand that classical rules were in place for this shot.  Too bad that the "arrow light" is so high on her face.  I would have preferred it at chin level or a little lower.  Love the background colour', '2004-01-28 13:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(560762, 57289, 14398, '<td valign="top">Interesting red bakground...</td>', 'Interesting red bakground...', '2004-01-28 13:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(560763, 57218, 10047, '<td valign="top">Unique and excellent photo. Nice colors, shading, and contrast. The bow hand is a little out of focus, and the string hand should be on her cheek, but those are minor.</td>', 'Unique and excellent photo. Nice colors, shading, and contrast. The bow hand is a little out of focus, and the string hand should be on her cheek, but those are minor.', '2004-01-28 13:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(560764, 57225, 14398, '<td valign="top">Looks a little blurry. And maybe a little to brightened, suggested form the popped pixels. Nice idea!</td>', 'Looks a little blurry. And maybe a little to brightened, suggested form the popped pixels. Nice idea!', '2004-01-28 13:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(560765, 57178, 14398, '<td valign="top">Nice little touch with the long hair only revealing a part of her face.</td>', 'Nice little touch with the long hair only revealing a part of her face.', '2004-01-28 13:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(560767, 57306, 14398, '<td valign="top">Creative...</td>', 'Creative...', '2004-01-28 13:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(560768, 57218, 14398, '<td valign="top">Fantastic.</td>', 'Fantastic.', '2004-01-28 13:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
