(560770, 57274, 11738, '<td valign="top">The skin tone on this shot seems to be off: too orange.  What seems to be the kitche sink in the background is also a bit distracting.  The upper right corner is quite blown out.  Good idea of using coloured water to give this shot mor impact.</td>', 'The skin tone on this shot seems to be off: too orange.  What seems to be the kitche sink in the background is also a bit distracting.  The upper right corner is quite blown out.  Good idea of using coloured water to give this shot mor impact.', '2004-01-28 13:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(560773, 57279, 14398, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of the shutter. The in and outs of the water is great. a bit dark though.</td>', 'Interesting use of the shutter. The in and outs of the water is great. a bit dark though.', '2004-01-28 14:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(560775, 57217, 11738, '<td valign="top">This is an very nice old scale: very nice subject matter.  However, I&lt;m not crazy about the angle used.  I find it too direct.  Could have ben better is shot from higher above.  Also, the part of the wall between the two arrows is overexposed.  I would continue experimenting with this subject matter to try to come up with a better lit and framed shot.</td>', 'This is an very nice old scale: very nice subject matter.  However, I<m not crazy about the angle used.  I find it too direct.  Could have ben better is shot from higher above.  Also, the part of the wall between the two arrows is overexposed.  I would continue experimenting with this subject matter to try to come up with a better lit and framed shot.', '2004-01-28 14:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(560778, 57218, 13891, '<td valign="top">Very clever idea and well executed</td>', 'Very clever idea and well executed', '2004-01-28 14:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(560780, 57137, 11738, '<td valign="top">Way cool tatoo.  I love the use of negative balck space, but I find the angle of this shot too steep.  Creates a weird effect and makes the left shoulder blade look abnormal.</td>', 'Way cool tatoo.  I love the use of negative balck space, but I find the angle of this shot too steep.  Creates a weird effect and makes the left shoulder blade look abnormal.', '2004-01-28 14:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
