(560863, 56800, 11295, '<td valign="top">A cute idea, and pretty well done. The shadows, unfortunately, are far too harsh. It detracts from the subject matter. Light from above would undoubtedly have taken the edge off.</td>', 'A cute idea, and pretty well done. The shadows, unfortunately, are far too harsh. It detracts from the subject matter. Light from above would undoubtedly have taken the edge off.', '2004-01-28 15:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
