(561018, 57322, 15026, '<td valign="top">Decent composition and lighting - seems a little flat - might be the reduced size of the photo for this site.  Is it clearer and with more depth in the original?  There are many distractions - perhaps intentional - but distractions nonetheless.  My eye tends to jump around the image and does not land on a satisfactory focal point or points.  Might not be the best way of explaing it.</td>', 'Decent composition and lighting - seems a little flat - might be the reduced size of the photo for this site.  Is it clearer and with more depth in the original?  There are many distractions - perhaps intentional - but distractions nonetheless.  My eye tends to jump around the image and does not land on a satisfactory focal point or points.  Might not be the best way of explaing it.', '2004-01-28 17:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(561022, 57181, 7889, '<td valign="top">Its a nice cat, the reflection in the eyes really spoil this and while Leo is a ''cat'' this does not work very well for me.</td>', 'Its a nice cat, the reflection in the eyes really spoil this and while Leo is a ''cat'' this does not work very well for me.', '2004-01-28 17:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(561026, 57123, 15026, '<td valign="top">I like the stone arrow tip - nice subject.  Background is a little muddy and busy - I understand that it is probably supposed to look like a long forgotten artifact, but the background detracts a little from the arrow.  The weed in the lower right is out of focus and a little distracting as well.  Overall, I like this picture.  Good lighting and detail on the arrow.</td>', 'I like the stone arrow tip - nice subject.  Background is a little muddy and busy - I understand that it is probably supposed to look like a long forgotten artifact, but the background detracts a little from the arrow.  The weed in the lower right is out of focus and a little distracting as well.  Overall, I like this picture.  Good lighting and detail on the arrow.', '2004-01-28 17:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
