(561291, 57122, 15242, '<td valign="top">A couple of spots are hurting you in there and you could crop more off the top..  Otherwise, great shot, good job of lighting it.</td>', 'A couple of spots are hurting you in there and you could crop more off the top..  Otherwise, great shot, good job of lighting it.', '2004-01-28 20:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
