(561307, 57181, 14773, '<td valign="top">out of focus and bad light - the bright eyes freak me out! lol j/k.  Unfortunately is a more like a snap shot.</td>', 'out of focus and bad light - the bright eyes freak me out! lol j/k.  Unfortunately is a more like a snap shot.', '2004-01-28 21:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
