(561320, 56784, 2792, '<td valign="top">I sense a ribbon!  Creative idea and great composition!  Wish there wasn''t a reflection, but thats a minor point.  My fav so far.</td>', 'I sense a ribbon!  Creative idea and great composition!  Wish there wasn''t a reflection, but thats a minor point.  My fav so far.', '2004-01-28 21:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(561327, 56711, 16695, '<td valign="top">It''s sharp and the blurred background implies motion, but the foreground still fails to keep my attention.  The concept is there, but the fact that it''s simply an arrowhead tip doesn''t really keep me interested.</td>', 'It''s sharp and the blurred background implies motion, but the foreground still fails to keep my attention.  The concept is there, but the fact that it''s simply an arrowhead tip doesn''t really keep me interested.', '2004-01-28 21:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(561328, 57297, 6600, '<td valign="top">Did the (Culligan?) guy you were shooting this?.... Composition ok, butt a bit of noise (specks) and a few hot areas (on jugs).</td>', 'Did the (Culligan?) guy you were shooting this?.... Composition ok, butt a bit of noise (specks) and a few hot areas (on jugs).', '2004-01-28 21:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(561333, 56663, 12268, '<td valign="top">most reative of the bunch! 8</td>', 'most reative of the bunch! 8', '2004-01-28 21:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(561335, 56748, 6600, '<td valign="top">Sorry, this sign doesn''t do a thing for me, it''s very one dimensional, oversharpened perhaps, and appears to have it''s share of noise.</td>', 'Sorry, this sign doesn''t do a thing for me, it''s very one dimensional, oversharpened perhaps, and appears to have it''s share of noise.', '2004-01-28 21:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(561336, 57325, 16695, '<td valign="top">Unless this is a constellation I''m not aware of, then I''d say this photo as a whole is rather bland.  I like the idea, but it feels a bit too empty to work. Too much negative space with too little charisma to carry on the rest of the elements.  Best of luck, though!</td>', 'Unless this is a constellation I''m not aware of, then I''d say this photo as a whole is rather bland.  I like the idea, but it feels a bit too empty to work. Too much negative space with too little charisma to carry on the rest of the elements.  Best of luck, though!', '2004-01-28 21:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(561338, 57122, 12160, '<td valign="top">beautiful colours, very sharp image, well done.</td>', 'beautiful colours, very sharp image, well done.', '2004-01-28 21:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(561339, 57030, 6600, '<td valign="top">Composition and color are good - a bit underexposed perhaps - a tad dark on my monitor.  Nice job.</td>', 'Composition and color are good - a bit underexposed perhaps - a tad dark on my monitor.  Nice job.', '2004-01-28 21:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(561342, 57188, 16695, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  From the thumbnail, I couldn''t tell what the heck this was.  I like how you''ve focused on the horn element; it definitely makes the viewer take in the photo differently.  Instead of normally focusing on the face and then outwards, we''re brough spiralling to the edge of the image.  :) Very nice.</td>', 'Very interesting.  From the thumbnail, I couldn''t tell what the heck this was.  I like how you''ve focused on the horn element; it definitely makes the viewer take in the photo differently.  Instead of normally focusing on the face and then outwards, we''re brough spiralling to the edge of the image.  :) Very nice.', '2004-01-28 21:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(561343, 56988, 6600, '<td valign="top">The background is bright, but the cow is a bit underexposed.  High contrast composition... tough to nail down.</td>', 'The background is bright, but the cow is a bit underexposed.  High contrast composition... tough to nail down.', '2004-01-28 21:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(561346, 56784, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice incorporation of the two items.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice incorporation of the two items.  Good job.', '2004-01-28 21:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(561347, 57029, 15242, '<td valign="top">For what ever reason I can''t keep my eyes from drifting to the fuzzy light spot under the right arm.  Otherwise I like the shot.</td>', 'For what ever reason I can''t keep my eyes from drifting to the fuzzy light spot under the right arm.  Otherwise I like the shot.', '2004-01-28 21:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(561349, 57297, 16695, '<td valign="top">LOL, the title obviously makes this.  The photo itself isn''t too bad either, but it''s all about the implications here.  hehe, good stuff.</td>', 'LOL, the title obviously makes this.  The photo itself isn''t too bad either, but it''s all about the implications here.  hehe, good stuff.', '2004-01-28 21:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(561350, 57248, 15242, '<td valign="top">Lighting is way too harsh.  A closer shot from another angle may have been better?</td>', 'Lighting is way too harsh.  A closer shot from another angle may have been better?', '2004-01-28 21:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(561353, 56663, 15242, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but there is some fuzz in the top right and it seems out of focus.</td>', 'Good idea, but there is some fuzz in the top right and it seems out of focus.', '2004-01-28 21:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(561355, 56459, 15242, '<td valign="top">Too much post processing.  Notice the noise in the sky on the left.</td>', 'Too much post processing.  Notice the noise in the sky on the left.', '2004-01-28 21:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(561356, 56575, 15330, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I like the lighting, you went with the lit from behind idea but kept a lot of the detail in the photo, didn''t just settle for a siluet. To improve this I think a white, smooth background would have been better. That would make all of the shadows in the lion stand out. The wood table, and the grainy background don''t help things in my opinion.</td>', 'Great shot. I like the lighting, you went with the lit from behind idea but kept a lot of the detail in the photo, didn''t just settle for a siluet. To improve this I think a white, smooth background would have been better. That would make all of the shadows in the lion stand out. The wood table, and the grainy background don''t help things in my opinion.', '2004-01-28 21:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(561357, 57047, 6532, '<td valign="top">a bit dull.....</td>', 'a bit dull.....', '2004-01-28 21:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(561358, 57225, 16648, '<td valign="top">i like it, but i see flaws, perhaps intential in focus/DOF, and the basket in the background? the light area behind the scale post/support is noisy. lighting is nice, directional yet sufficient</td>', 'i like it, but i see flaws, perhaps intential in focus/DOF, and the basket in the background? the light area behind the scale post/support is noisy. lighting is nice, directional yet sufficient', '2004-01-28 21:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(561359, 57252, 15242, '<td valign="top">That bright over powers the shot.</td>', 'That bright over powers the shot.', '2004-01-28 21:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(561360, 57243, 15330, '<td valign="top">I really like the shadows, and soft tones. I think that the light in the upper left corner is a little distracting since it is just plain white.</td>', 'I really like the shadows, and soft tones. I think that the light in the upper left corner is a little distracting since it is just plain white.', '2004-01-28 21:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(561362, 57298, 16648, '<td valign="top">no centered, not artsy, just off center</td>', 'no centered, not artsy, just off center', '2004-01-28 21:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(561364, 56459, 6532, '<td valign="top">too much of the building hides the  outline of the lion..... otherwise, great colors<br/></td>', 'too much of the building hides the  outline of the lion..... otherwise, great colors', '2004-01-28 22:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(561365, 57268, 15330, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, and the perspective you took. You could probobly improve the composition a little, the bulls head seems to be in the middle of the frame. I like the way you blurred the background, really makes the subject stand out. You should have (maybe you did) tried the shot with a little softer light and a slower shutter speed, or bigger aperture so that the highlights weren''t as bright. The right part of the picture seems out of focus, this was probobly intentional but it might have looked better if the bull was comepletely in focus. Overall very good shot.</td>', 'I like the shot, and the perspective you took. You could probobly improve the composition a little, the bulls head seems to be in the middle of the frame. I like the way you blurred the background, really makes the subject stand out. You should have (maybe you did) tried the shot with a little softer light and a slower shutter speed, or bigger aperture so that the highlights weren''t as bright. The right part of the picture seems out of focus, this was probobly intentional but it might have looked better if the bull was comepletely in focus. Overall very good shot.', '2004-01-28 22:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(561368, 57189, 6532, '<td valign="top">cool.  how did it look with the constellations being the focus?<br/></td>', 'cool.  how did it look with the constellations being the focus?', '2004-01-28 22:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(561369, 57201, 15242, '<td valign="top">Not sure how it applies to the zodiac signs, but I''m no expert on that.  Personally I find no interest in the shot and the spot light is annoying.  Maybe I just don''t get it.</td>', 'Not sure how it applies to the zodiac signs, but I''m no expert on that.  Personally I find no interest in the shot and the spot light is annoying.  Maybe I just don''t get it.', '2004-01-28 22:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(561370, 57076, 15330, '<td valign="top">I like the way you made the background black, really makes the yellow stand out. Good job.</td>', 'I like the way you made the background black, really makes the yellow stand out. Good job.', '2004-01-28 22:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(561371, 56828, 15242, '<td valign="top">Crop a little more off the top and bottom.  Maybe a little over processed too, but otherwise a great shot.</td>', 'Crop a little more off the top and bottom.  Maybe a little over processed too, but otherwise a great shot.', '2004-01-28 22:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(561372, 57164, 16648, '<td valign="top">i like the color and such, but the statue is off center, and with all the geometry here and both sides of the arch visible, it is distracting for it to be off center</td>', 'i like the color and such, but the statue is off center, and with all the geometry here and both sides of the arch visible, it is distracting for it to be off center', '2004-01-28 22:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(561374, 57165, 6532, '<td valign="top">IT''S CROOKED</td>', 'IT''S CROOKED', '2004-01-28 22:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(561375, 57031, 16648, '<td valign="top">aquarium pictures are difficult (i have tried!) - the fish are blurry due to too slow a shutter speed (difficult wihtout a LOT of light) but the plants are blurry too - focus issue i think, but tht ecamera may have moved. The exposure is uneven too - overexpsed on the left/top and under on the right/bottom.<br/> <br/>Get the lights on, and the cam on a tripod, and wait without moving. the fish will settle done a bit, and then take 100 pictures. you may, may just get 1 good one.<br/> <br/>I find it to be one of the most challenging things to photograph, although the local zoo aquarium pics i took are not too bad.</td>', 'aquarium pictures are difficult (i have tried!) - the fish are blurry due to too slow a shutter speed (difficult wihtout a LOT of light) but the plants are blurry too - focus issue i think, but tht ecamera may have moved. The exposure is uneven too - overexpsed on the left/top and under on the right/bottom. Get the lights on, and the cam on a tripod, and wait without moving. the fish will settle done a bit, and then take 100 pictures. you may, may just get 1 good one. I find it to be one of the most challenging things to photograph, although the local zoo aquarium pics i took are not too bad.', '2004-01-28 22:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(561376, 57211, 6600, '<td valign="top">A ''filtered'' tatto?</td>', 'A ''filtered'' tatto?', '2004-01-28 22:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(561379, 57150, 15242, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the effect.</td>', 'I don''t like the effect.', '2004-01-28 22:08:49.000000', NULL, 1);
