(561381, 57134, 16648, '<td valign="top">concdpt is good, but the left scale chains are blurry (movement) and is distracting, as is the stick in the middle. Also, the sclaes seem out of focus.  sky is pretty</td>', 'concdpt is good, but the left scale chains are blurry (movement) and is distracting, as is the stick in the middle. Also, the sclaes seem out of focus.  sky is pretty', '2004-01-28 22:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
