(561931, 56663, 16402, '<td valign="top">Cute</td>', 'Cute', '2004-01-29 12:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(561933, 57298, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting viewpoint and unusual composition. Not keen on the blurry effect or the green tone of the lighting.</td>', 'Interesting viewpoint and unusual composition. Not keen on the blurry effect or the green tone of the lighting.', '2004-01-29 12:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(561934, 56927, 16402, '<td valign="top">I like the creative approach to shooting a static subject but image is so tight in frame that it is hard to recognize.</td>', 'I like the creative approach to shooting a static subject but image is so tight in frame that it is hard to recognize.', '2004-01-29 12:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(561935, 57232, 3087, '<td valign="top">Personally, although I''m happy to accept that your interpretation is as valid as more obvious ones, it certainly doesn''t convey the theme to me in any way.<br/>Colour, close up and angle are quite striking.</td>', 'Personally, although I''m happy to accept that your interpretation is as valid as more obvious ones, it certainly doesn''t convey the theme to me in any way.Colour, close up and angle are quite striking.', '2004-01-29 12:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(561936, 57325, 3087, '<td valign="top">Simple and attractive though i think it lacks a focal point.</td>', 'Simple and attractive though i think it lacks a focal point.', '2004-01-29 12:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(561937, 57304, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting light and shadow but not enough interest for me in terms of the content itself.</td>', 'Interesting light and shadow but not enough interest for me in terms of the content itself.', '2004-01-29 12:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(561938, 57304, 16402, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, nice color, great use of light.</td>', 'Nice composition, nice color, great use of light.', '2004-01-29 12:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(561939, 56780, 14035, '<td valign="top">ThIs is a very creative and wonderful interpretation - and except for the top left corner where the background  fabric  falls away it''s darn close to perfect in my opinion. I quite like  the  low contrast and your  DOF is lovely.</td>', 'ThIs is a very creative and wonderful interpretation - and except for the top left corner where the background  fabric  falls away it''s darn close to perfect in my opinion. I quite like  the  low contrast and your  DOF is lovely.', '2004-01-29 12:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(561940, 57122, 3087, '<td valign="top">What I "see" here is a shoal rather than a pair or even sets of pairs!<br/>Strong colours. Nicely lit to retain dark background. Lacks interest for me.</td>', 'What I "see" here is a shoal rather than a pair or even sets of pairs!Strong colours. Nicely lit to retain dark background. Lacks interest for me.', '2004-01-29 12:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(561941, 57303, 3087, '<td valign="top">His camouflage colourings mean he doesn''t stand out against the drab background, especially because the strong light is creating so many shadows from the rubble and branches. I would also suggest the composition might be better if he were looking into rather than out of the frame.</td>', 'His camouflage colourings mean he doesn''t stand out against the drab background, especially because the strong light is creating so many shadows from the rubble and branches. I would also suggest the composition might be better if he were looking into rather than out of the frame.', '2004-01-29 12:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(561943, 57225, 16402, '<td valign="top">I probably would have scored this higher but it is pretty uniformly out of focus and I honestly can''t tell if that is intentional or not.</td>', 'I probably would have scored this higher but it is pretty uniformly out of focus and I honestly can''t tell if that is intentional or not.', '2004-01-29 12:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(561946, 57025, 3087, '<td valign="top">The lone hand, in this position, doesn''t convey friendship or loyalty to me - perhaps it may have done if the viewpoint were of the hand reaching towards me? I like the image itself a lot, the detail comes through well in black and white. Lighting is a little harsh - my focus keeps returning to those white fingertips.</td>', 'The lone hand, in this position, doesn''t convey friendship or loyalty to me - perhaps it may have done if the viewpoint were of the hand reaching towards me? I like the image itself a lot, the detail comes through well in black and white. Lighting is a little harsh - my focus keeps returning to those white fingertips.', '2004-01-29 12:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(561947, 57181, 14035, '<td valign="top">The  cat/lion jump is a little hard for me.  I like the background color as contrast to the cat''s color but the cat itself is a little soft.  It looks to be a flash shot, perhaps you could try some indirect softer lighting.</td>', 'The  cat/lion jump is a little hard for me.  I like the background color as contrast to the cat''s color but the cat itself is a little soft.  It looks to be a flash shot, perhaps you could try some indirect softer lighting.', '2004-01-29 12:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(561948, 57307, 16402, '<td valign="top">One of the nicer fish photos. Just a bit more depth of field and it would have been even better.</td>', 'One of the nicer fish photos. Just a bit more depth of field and it would have been even better.', '2004-01-29 12:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(561950, 57025, 16402, '<td valign="top">Huh?</td>', 'Huh?', '2004-01-29 12:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(561953, 56828, 16402, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure. I''d have certainly cropped the bottom much tighter.</td>', 'Nice exposure. I''d have certainly cropped the bottom much tighter.', '2004-01-29 12:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(561955, 56828, 3087, '<td valign="top">Well captured. Whilst I don''t have the fanatical belief some do that all images mustb be original ideas I do think this doesn''t really add anything new to the thousands of moon crescent photos out there in the world and therefore it doesn''t really capture my interest. But in terms of technical success - I think it''s nicely done.</td>', 'Well captured. Whilst I don''t have the fanatical belief some do that all images mustb be original ideas I do think this doesn''t really add anything new to the thousands of moon crescent photos out there in the world and therefore it doesn''t really capture my interest. But in terms of technical success - I think it''s nicely done.', '2004-01-29 12:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(561956, 57087, 16402, '<td valign="top">This is just too far a reach on the subject, in my humble opinion.</td>', 'This is just too far a reach on the subject, in my humble opinion.', '2004-01-29 12:55:31.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(561957, 57267, 16402, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject matter and lighting.</td>', 'Very interesting subject matter and lighting.', '2004-01-29 12:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(561959, 57131, 3087, '<td valign="top">Given that the challenge is to represent one of the signs of the zodiac my feeling is that traditional crabs, that are closer to the most commonly seen image of the Cancer sign, would be better used here. <br/>In terms of the image itself I think that the frame feels crowded - the crop is very close to the edge of the subject - it feels too close to me. The colour of the background doesn''t appeal to me and the fanned out stripes toward both top corners are a little distracting - they don''t add anything.</td>', 'Given that the challenge is to represent one of the signs of the zodiac my feeling is that traditional crabs, that are closer to the most commonly seen image of the Cancer sign, would be better used here. In terms of the image itself I think that the frame feels crowded - the crop is very close to the edge of the subject - it feels too close to me. The colour of the background doesn''t appeal to me and the fanned out stripes toward both top corners are a little distracting - they don''t add anything.', '2004-01-29 12:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(561960, 57265, 12268, '<td valign="top">is this a lobster? Regardless, I like the angle &amp; composition. I also changed your score, bumped it up to an 8!</td>', 'is this a lobster? Regardless, I like the angle & composition. I also changed your score, bumped it up to an 8!', '2004-01-29 12:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(561961, 57036, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect and colours but lacks a focal point.</td>', 'Interesting effect and colours but lacks a focal point.', '2004-01-29 12:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(561963, 57305, 16402, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but the lack of focus really brings it down for me.</td>', 'I like the composition, but the lack of focus really brings it down for me.', '2004-01-29 13:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(561964, 57252, 3087, '<td valign="top">Undeniably a lion though not one that conveys the zodiac sign very strongly to me. <br/>Photo suffers from lighting - I think it''s the direction of the (rather strong) light that''s causing that white faded effect on the back of the lion''s mane. The focus seems to be aimed at the background - the lion seems soft but the STOP posters in the background are sharp. I kind of like the haphazard jumble of signs, concrete barrier and old petrol pump behind him - gives a slightly surreal air to the image.</td>', 'Undeniably a lion though not one that conveys the zodiac sign very strongly to me. Photo suffers from lighting - I think it''s the direction of the (rather strong) light that''s causing that white faded effect on the back of the lion''s mane. The focus seems to be aimed at the background - the lion seems soft but the STOP posters in the background are sharp. I kind of like the haphazard jumble of signs, concrete barrier and old petrol pump behind him - gives a slightly surreal air to the image.', '2004-01-29 13:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(561966, 56692, 16402, '<td valign="top">I''d have cropped it tighter.</td>', 'I''d have cropped it tighter.', '2004-01-29 13:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(561969, 56780, 15919, '<td valign="top">Very good shot.  The pose of the model related to the beautiful prop and the soft focus gives it a lot.  The lightning seems very good.  The only thing that distracts is that the sheet dosent cover the top left corner (not sure everybody will notice).</td>', 'Very good shot.  The pose of the model related to the beautiful prop and the soft focus gives it a lot.  The lightning seems very good.  The only thing that distracts is that the sheet dosent cover the top left corner (not sure everybody will notice).', '2004-01-29 13:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(561970, 57203, 16402, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting and choice to silhouette.</td>', 'Love the lighting and choice to silhouette.', '2004-01-29 13:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(561973, 57030, 15919, '<td valign="top">Very good lightning, gives beautiful colorbalance</td>', 'Very good lightning, gives beautiful colorbalance', '2004-01-29 13:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(561975, 57181, 16402, '<td valign="top">Yellow eyes and lack of focus are big problems here.</td>', 'Yellow eyes and lack of focus are big problems here.', '2004-01-29 13:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(561977, 57058, 16402, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t fit theme.</td>', 'Doesn''t fit theme.', '2004-01-29 13:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(561978, 56814, 3087, '<td valign="top">Cute! Lighting a little uneven between top and bottom.</td>', 'Cute! Lighting a little uneven between top and bottom.', '2004-01-29 13:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(561979, 57289, 15919, '<td valign="top">How did you get this color of the sky???  Good lightning and texture.</td>', 'How did you get this color of the sky???  Good lightning and texture.', '2004-01-29 13:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(561980, 57217, 16402, '<td valign="top">I might have gone for a softer lighting but overall very nice.</td>', 'I might have gone for a softer lighting but overall very nice.', '2004-01-29 13:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(561984, 56459, 15919, '<td valign="top">Very sharp and good shot.  Maby litle to much shadow below, how about fill in flash?</td>', 'Very sharp and good shot.  Maby litle to much shadow below, how about fill in flash?', '2004-01-29 13:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(561986, 57029, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Feels too soft - not sure about textured wallpaper as backdrop - plain might suit the low-key nature of this image better.</td>', 'Nice image. Feels too soft - not sure about textured wallpaper as backdrop - plain might suit the low-key nature of this image better.', '2004-01-29 13:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(561987, 57243, 15919, '<td valign="top">Very sharp and well lit, gives good shadows</td>', 'Very sharp and well lit, gives good shadows', '2004-01-29 13:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(561988, 57095, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the way you''ve positioned the object on the marked paper... adds some interest to what might otherwise be just a shot of an ornament.</td>', 'I like the way you''ve positioned the object on the marked paper... adds some interest to what might otherwise be just a shot of an ornament.', '2004-01-29 13:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(561991, 56641, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful movement and shapes in the water and an interesting diagonal composition.</td>', 'Beautiful movement and shapes in the water and an interesting diagonal composition.', '2004-01-29 13:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(561993, 57225, 3087, '<td valign="top">Focus and image quality let this down. Content holds some interest though I wonder if a cloth of contrasting colour to the scales might have added more interest?</td>', 'Focus and image quality let this down. Content holds some interest though I wonder if a cloth of contrasting colour to the scales might have added more interest?', '2004-01-29 13:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(562054, 56784, 11895, '<td valign="top">would have been better with some light on the back of the crab, the light there is seems a blit over exposed on the legs to the left<br/></td>', 'would have been better with some light on the back of the crab, the light there is seems a blit over exposed on the legs to the left', '2004-01-29 14:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(562071, 56847, 3087, '<td valign="top">Abstract is nice but I still need a compositional focal point - my eye is wondering all over and not really alighting on anything. Personally, that''s not a good thing.</td>', 'Abstract is nice but I still need a compositional focal point - my eye is wondering all over and not really alighting on anything. Personally, that''s not a good thing.', '2004-01-29 15:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(562072, 57164, 3087, '<td valign="top">Content is not hugely interesting and the image seems rather flat, tonally.</td>', 'Content is not hugely interesting and the image seems rather flat, tonally.', '2004-01-29 15:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(562075, 56801, 3087, '<td valign="top">Image quality/ focus are poor. Image lacks punch/ interest.</td>', 'Image quality/ focus are poor. Image lacks punch/ interest.', '2004-01-29 15:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(562078, 57267, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lighting is too harsh and the wall behind isn''t too attractive but the image does draw me in for a second look. Other than the fact that the text spells out a zodiac sign I am not sure what the idea is here - is there meaning in someone writing this on a mirror? Not sure.</td>', 'Lighting is too harsh and the wall behind isn''t too attractive but the image does draw me in for a second look. Other than the fact that the text spells out a zodiac sign I am not sure what the idea is here - is there meaning in someone writing this on a mirror? Not sure.', '2004-01-29 15:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(562083, 57150, 1563, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture, nice contrast and the stars in the sky give it an extra edge</td>', 'Excellent picture, nice contrast and the stars in the sky give it an extra edge', '2004-01-29 15:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(562086, 56275, 1563, '<td valign="top">Excellent Pic, would love to see the specs on this one? 2 lights (red and blue?) turned on and off on shooting time bulb? or 30 sec?</td>', 'Excellent Pic, would love to see the specs on this one? 2 lights (red and blue?) turned on and off on shooting time bulb? or 30 sec?', '2004-01-29 15:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(562088, 56575, 1563, '<td valign="top">Just because I''m a leo you are getting a bit higher score.<br/>Plus a very nice pic and leo, might have used a soft light on the front too, a bit from above :D</td>', 'Just because I''m a leo you are getting a bit higher score.Plus a very nice pic and leo, might have used a soft light on the front too, a bit from above :D', '2004-01-29 15:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(562100, 57030, 3087, '<td valign="top">Makes me hungry! Interesting low viewpoint.</td>', 'Makes me hungry! Interesting low viewpoint.', '2004-01-29 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(562104, 56784, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea though I''d like to see some light on the crab body to bring colour to it also.</td>', 'Interesting idea though I''d like to see some light on the crab body to bring colour to it also.', '2004-01-29 16:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(562106, 57282, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and I like the simplicity with which you''ve captured it - The highly textured surface really adds to the interest.</td>', 'Nice idea and I like the simplicity with which you''ve captured it - The highly textured surface really adds to the interest.', '2004-01-29 16:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(562107, 56668, 1563, '<td valign="top">Nice Idea, never would have come up with this one by myself.  10</td>', 'Nice Idea, never would have come up with this one by myself.  10', '2004-01-29 16:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(562108, 57188, 1563, '<td valign="top">Nice looking statue, great picture, strong contast.  Having it B/W probably makes it stronger than it would be in color.</td>', 'Nice looking statue, great picture, strong contast.  Having it B/W probably makes it stronger than it would be in color.', '2004-01-29 16:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(562111, 57201, 1563, '<td valign="top">Sorry, feels like a snapshot.  Like you haven''t had enough time to find a more creative subject.  Sure you''ll do better next time.</td>', 'Sorry, feels like a snapshot.  Like you haven''t had enough time to find a more creative subject.  Sure you''ll do better next time.', '2004-01-29 16:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(562113, 57324, 1563, '<td valign="top">Not impressed, I get a snapshot feeling when looking at this picture.  Perhaps you should have made this a silhoutte picture. Think that would have made a better impression. at least on me.</td>', 'Not impressed, I get a snapshot feeling when looking at this picture.  Perhaps you should have made this a silhoutte picture. Think that would have made a better impression. at least on me.', '2004-01-29 16:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(562114, 57090, 1563, '<td valign="top">Never had that Idea about people in the Aquarius sign, but come to think about it you are correct. Excellent setup and picture.</td>', 'Never had that Idea about people in the Aquarius sign, but come to think about it you are correct. Excellent setup and picture.', '2004-01-29 16:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(562115, 57204, 3087, '<td valign="top">A nice image but feels to me that I''m admiring the creativity of the artist that produced the ornament rather than the creativity on the part of the photographer.</td>', 'A nice image but feels to me that I''m admiring the creativity of the artist that produced the ornament rather than the creativity on the part of the photographer.', '2004-01-29 16:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(562116, 56780, 1563, '<td valign="top">The soft focus on this picture makes me want to give it a higher score. Very good picture</td>', 'The soft focus on this picture makes me want to give it a higher score. Very good picture', '2004-01-29 16:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(562120, 57110, 1563, '<td valign="top">Not quite getting the idea, chastity belt? Perhaps I''m being narrow minded.<br/>The colors are good and the lock nice, layout ok, 7<br/>Perhaps if having a woman in the background showing stomach would have raised your score to 10</td>', 'Not quite getting the idea, chastity belt? Perhaps I''m being narrow minded.The colors are good and the lock nice, layout ok, 7Perhaps if having a woman in the background showing stomach would have raised your score to 10', '2004-01-29 16:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(562121, 57303, 1563, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, think it would be better if you had cropped everything out except the scorpio.</td>', 'Nice picture, think it would be better if you had cropped everything out except the scorpio.', '2004-01-29 16:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(562122, 57306, 1563, '<td valign="top">Cool</td>', 'Cool', '2004-01-29 16:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(562123, 57029, 1563, '<td valign="top">A bit grainy but a very strong picture. 9</td>', 'A bit grainy but a very strong picture. 9', '2004-01-29 16:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(562124, 57193, 1563, '<td valign="top">A bit to grainy and off focus for  my personal interest, but a very good idea. perhaps a stronger light would have made it stronger.</td>', 'A bit to grainy and off focus for  my personal interest, but a very good idea. perhaps a stronger light would have made it stronger.', '2004-01-29 16:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(562125, 57279, 1563, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture, the flowing of the water (being pourin into the cannister?) sold it to me.</td>', 'Excellent picture, the flowing of the water (being pourin into the cannister?) sold it to me.', '2004-01-29 16:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(562126, 56709, 1563, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture. a bit too gray. how does it come out with more saturation?</td>', 'Excellent picture. a bit too gray. how does it come out with more saturation?', '2004-01-29 16:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(562129, 57251, 7889, '<td valign="top">Its a lovely portrait of a charming young lady. well done</td>', 'Its a lovely portrait of a charming young lady. well done', '2004-01-29 16:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(562130, 57164, 7889, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W works well with this subject, maybe a little more contrast would have helped? Its a good shot nevertheless.</td>', 'B&W works well with this subject, maybe a little more contrast would have helped? Its a good shot nevertheless.', '2004-01-29 16:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(562131, 57036, 7889, '<td valign="top">Topical! DOF lets this down a little, but colour is good.</td>', 'Topical! DOF lets this down a little, but colour is good.', '2004-01-29 16:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(562133, 56229, 7889, '<td valign="top">Good DOF on this shot, nice shadow and detail of the face</td>', 'Good DOF on this shot, nice shadow and detail of the face', '2004-01-29 16:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(562134, 56983, 7889, '<td valign="top">Very clever! might have been better in B&amp;W?</td>', 'Very clever! might have been better in B&W?', '2004-01-29 16:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(562135, 56711, 7889, '<td valign="top">Interesting technique and well executed</td>', 'Interesting technique and well executed', '2004-01-29 16:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(562147, 57181, 16695, '<td valign="top">Sorry to be blunt, but... poor focus, harsh lighting, bland subject.  The colors are vibrant, though! ;)</td>', 'Sorry to be blunt, but... poor focus, harsh lighting, bland subject.  The colors are vibrant, though! ;)', '2004-01-29 16:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(562149, 56445, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice enough image but don''t like the inversion. <br/> <br/>EDIT: I understand from our PMs that this isn''t an inversion but a glass paperweight! Thanks for letting me know. Visually it looks like a negative - I guess that''s what I don''t like. What I do like is the texture around the edge.</td>', 'Nice enough image but don''t like the inversion.  EDIT: I understand from our PMs that this isn''t an inversion but a glass paperweight! Thanks for letting me know. Visually it looks like a negative - I guess that''s what I don''t like. What I do like is the texture around the edge.', '2004-01-29 16:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(562150, 56668, 16703, '<td valign="top">very nice....</td>', 'very nice....', '2004-01-29 16:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(562151, 57201, 16703, '<td valign="top">i think more light on moon or darkening out the rest would have put better focus on the moon...</td>', 'i think more light on moon or darkening out the rest would have put better focus on the moon...', '2004-01-29 16:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(562152, 56709, 8860, '<td valign="top">A refreshingly artistic approach in an extremely bland challenge, this is painterly and thoroughly evocative as an image. A shot like this will not tire with repeat viewings as many of the others will. It''s a little noisy, but perhaps this is a technical limitation and the creative merit more than supplements this. [10]</td>', 'A refreshingly artistic approach in an extremely bland challenge, this is painterly and thoroughly evocative as an image. A shot like this will not tire with repeat viewings as many of the others will. It''s a little noisy, but perhaps this is a technical limitation and the creative merit more than supplements this. [10]', '2004-01-29 16:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(562153, 56815, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very good capture and I like the gloomy, low-key take on the challenge.Shot is a little ill-defined and extremes of contrast, but I like it.</td>', 'Very good capture and I like the gloomy, low-key take on the challenge.Shot is a little ill-defined and extremes of contrast, but I like it.', '2004-01-29 16:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(562155, 57036, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice creative idea, well executed. DOF is narrow though and would benefit your concept if most of these droplets were quite focused. Good colour and composition with excellent illusive quality.</td>', 'Nice creative idea, well executed. DOF is narrow though and would benefit your concept if most of these droplets were quite focused. Good colour and composition with excellent illusive quality.', '2004-01-29 16:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(562158, 57306, 7628, '<td valign="top">This is a fun and creative idea.  The illusion works well.</td>', 'This is a fun and creative idea.  The illusion works well.', '2004-01-29 16:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(562159, 57131, 16695, '<td valign="top">Sharp detail, but the angle on this doesn''t really provide anything engaging for the viewer.  The background almost looks textured, but simply remains confusing and detracts from the subject.</td>', 'Sharp detail, but the angle on this doesn''t really provide anything engaging for the viewer.  The background almost looks textured, but simply remains confusing and detracts from the subject.', '2004-01-29 16:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(562160, 57248, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the composition with the crab coming up out of the shadows.  The rocks are a bit bright, and I wish the crab were sharper</td>', 'I like the composition with the crab coming up out of the shadows.  The rocks are a bit bright, and I wish the crab were sharper', '2004-01-29 16:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(562162, 57218, 16695, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful.  I love the natural gradient in the background, the thickness of the arc, the perfect shape of it.  All around stunning and wonderfully executed.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful.  I love the natural gradient in the background, the thickness of the arc, the perfect shape of it.  All around stunning and wonderfully executed.', '2004-01-29 17:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(562163, 57264, 7628, '<td valign="top">Balanced enough to be libra too ;)  Nice range of tones.  Composition is tidy, but perhaps a bit boring?  Perhaps some dramatic lighting, or a more textured background?</td>', 'Balanced enough to be libra too ;)  Nice range of tones.  Composition is tidy, but perhaps a bit boring?  Perhaps some dramatic lighting, or a more textured background?', '2004-01-29 17:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(562164, 56229, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of the shaded, pale face with the bright colorful background.  You managed to get good detail in the face despite difficult lighting contitions.  Whatever she is carrying on her shoulder is a bit distracting.</td>', 'I like the contrast of the shaded, pale face with the bright colorful background.  You managed to get good detail in the face despite difficult lighting contitions.  Whatever she is carrying on her shoulder is a bit distracting.', '2004-01-29 17:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(562167, 57249, 7628, '<td valign="top">interesting to hve the subject seem so like the background and yet it stands out,  Are these clear glass pieces?  You have chosen a horizontal composition, and yet the libra symbol is slightly tilted.  It would be better with an obvious tilt, or esactly plumb.  I''d crop on the top - having more space below the sign implies the weighing of objects unseen, and having th imbalance in the composition invites your eye to wander more.</td>', 'interesting to hve the subject seem so like the background and yet it stands out,  Are these clear glass pieces?  You have chosen a horizontal composition, and yet the libra symbol is slightly tilted.  It would be better with an obvious tilt, or esactly plumb.  I''d crop on the top - having more space below the sign implies the weighing of objects unseen, and having th imbalance in the composition invites your eye to wander more.', '2004-01-29 17:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(562176, 57232, 7628, '<td valign="top">startling color and perspective compared to others in the challenge.  Good thinking ot of the box,  You could do a series of these unexpected zodiac, could make a cool poster.</td>', 'startling color and perspective compared to others in the challenge.  Good thinking ot of the box,  You could do a series of these unexpected zodiac, could make a cool poster.', '2004-01-29 17:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(562177, 56848, 7628, '<td valign="top">clever tilte.  I particularly like the sheen of the hair on the right hand goat.  The background is a bit busy and distracts fro the goats.</td>', 'clever tilte.  I particularly like the sheen of the hair on the right hand goat.  The background is a bit busy and distracts fro the goats.', '2004-01-29 17:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(562181, 57110, 7628, '<td valign="top">This looks like it requires a good bit of set up.  I like the lighting on the lock, and the dramatic background.  While the angle is interesting, I keep feeling the candle flame is pointing the wrong way, and it distracts me.</td>', 'This looks like it requires a good bit of set up.  I like the lighting on the lock, and the dramatic background.  While the angle is interesting, I keep feeling the candle flame is pointing the wrong way, and it distracts me.', '2004-01-29 17:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(562183, 56722, 7628, '<td valign="top">Intense stare!  I like the wonderful pear-shape of the body, you''ve cropped it just right.  The flare of the beard, those horns curvin behind the dark ears, and with the excellent use of DOF, your subject really pops out of the picture. 9</td>', 'Intense stare!  I like the wonderful pear-shape of the body, you''ve cropped it just right.  The flare of the beard, those horns curvin behind the dark ears, and with the excellent use of DOF, your subject really pops out of the picture. 9', '2004-01-29 17:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(562185, 57184, 7628, '<td valign="top">The texture of the icicles works well against the blackness and the gray grainy snow, but the white anglular shape is distracting.</td>', 'The texture of the icicles works well against the blackness and the gray grainy snow, but the white anglular shape is distracting.', '2004-01-29 17:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(562186, 57303, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the scorpion in these natural surroundings, and the composition is nice, he is frames around the top and side and seems ready to jump out on the viewer.  However, he blends in too well with the background and it makes him hard to see, and lowers the impact.  Could you make the yellow brighter?  Or desaturate the background? Perhaps a little selective editing after the challenge.</td>', 'I like the scorpion in these natural surroundings, and the composition is nice, he is frames around the top and side and seems ready to jump out on the viewer.  However, he blends in too well with the background and it makes him hard to see, and lowers the impact.  Could you make the yellow brighter?  Or desaturate the background? Perhaps a little selective editing after the challenge.', '2004-01-29 17:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(562188, 56983, 7628, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on gemini.  Looking up at the building is kindof like looking up at the constellation.  The composition is balanced, and the irregularities of the building make it interesting to look at.  Lighting seems a bit flat.</td>', 'Interesting take on gemini.  Looking up at the building is kindof like looking up at the constellation.  The composition is balanced, and the irregularities of the building make it interesting to look at.  Lighting seems a bit flat.', '2004-01-29 17:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(562191, 57159, 7628, '<td valign="top">great expression.  nice composition.  Perhaps remove the watch, and how would this have worked in b&amp;w or monotone?  Reds seem a bit strong. 8</td>', 'great expression.  nice composition.  Perhaps remove the watch, and how would this have worked in b&w or monotone?  Reds seem a bit strong. 8', '2004-01-29 17:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(562192, 57025, 12268, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. It is my fave from the bunch. It''s creative &amp; seriously moody. Love the sepia tone, lighting is excellent although a bit contradictory to the title. But who cares, 9</td>', 'I love this shot. It is my fave from the bunch. It''s creative & seriously moody. Love the sepia tone, lighting is excellent although a bit contradictory to the title. But who cares, 9', '2004-01-29 17:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(562193, 57265, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the little bit of ive on the mouth parts,  I wish it were sharper on the top of the shell.  Perhaps you could include a bit more of this interesting looking creature - the legs seem so cut-off.</td>', 'I like the little bit of ive on the mouth parts,  I wish it were sharper on the top of the shell.  Perhaps you could include a bit more of this interesting looking creature - the legs seem so cut-off.', '2004-01-29 17:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(562199, 57321, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like thesmooth texture of the water compared to the details in the hands,  Wish the whole hand was in focus to emphasize that difference in texture.</td>', 'I like thesmooth texture of the water compared to the details in the hands,  Wish the whole hand was in focus to emphasize that difference in texture.', '2004-01-29 17:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(562204, 57122, 7628, '<td valign="top">nice colors, fine reflections.  I''d crop the black on the top - the fishies are swallowed up by all that space above them.  Cropping down draws the eyes in more and them the eye can follow your wonderful line of fish.</td>', 'nice colors, fine reflections.  I''d crop the black on the top - the fishies are swallowed up by all that space above them.  Cropping down draws the eyes in more and them the eye can follow your wonderful line of fish.', '2004-01-29 17:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(562210, 57243, 7628, '<td valign="top">interesting to have the subject be what you can barely see - the balance.  But the weights and the shadows they cast.  Very cool looking image.  I wish the shadows were more distinct, they have a lot of space to fill for being fuzzy.  But then again isn;t that the problem with Libras (I am one) we weigh things, but can never quite make up our minds, they are always fuzzy. 8</td>', 'interesting to have the subject be what you can barely see - the balance.  But the weights and the shadows they cast.  Very cool looking image.  I wish the shadows were more distinct, they have a lot of space to fill for being fuzzy.  But then again isn;t that the problem with Libras (I am one) we weigh things, but can never quite make up our minds, they are always fuzzy. 8', '2004-01-29 17:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(562214, 57274, 7628, '<td valign="top">The color fo the water and the hand and the quality of the light are wonderful.  That shadow is distracting though.  Maybe a bit less white on the left, 7</td>', 'The color fo the water and the hand and the quality of the light are wonderful.  That shadow is distracting though.  Maybe a bit less white on the left, 7', '2004-01-29 17:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(562215, 57218, 7628, '<td valign="top">wonderful use of light.  I am interested to see your comments after the challenge and learn exactly how you did this.  Compelling composition, lovely background. 9</td>', 'wonderful use of light.  I am interested to see your comments after the challenge and learn exactly how you did this.  Compelling composition, lovely background. 9', '2004-01-29 17:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(562218, 56498, 15242, '<td valign="top">Obviously blurry and the back ground is quite distracting.  Try a more close up shot (in focus) of just the head in the same lighting conditions with the same effect.</td>', 'Obviously blurry and the back ground is quite distracting.  Try a more close up shot (in focus) of just the head in the same lighting conditions with the same effect.', '2004-01-29 17:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(562223, 56811, 15242, '<td valign="top">The focus is off, the background is distracting and the lighting isn''t very good.  On a set up shot those should all be close to perfect.  The subject isn''t very interesting either.</td>', 'The focus is off, the background is distracting and the lighting isn''t very good.  On a set up shot those should all be close to perfect.  The subject isn''t very interesting either.', '2004-01-29 17:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(562224, 57274, 15242, '<td valign="top">Crop off some of that bright over exposed area on the left and you have a better shot.</td>', 'Crop off some of that bright over exposed area on the left and you have a better shot.', '2004-01-29 17:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(562234, 57218, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is really one of my favorites, quite a lot of thought and imagination put into this.  I love the background choice in contrast to the black clothing, great lighting as well.  And as for the bow, well, spectacular!  They way you got it to go from narrow on the ends to wider in the middle, nice touch! Too bad no spot editing allowed, I''d get rid of those two dots on the wall, doesn''t that just drive you mad sometimes? :)  9 from me!</td>', 'This is really one of my favorites, quite a lot of thought and imagination put into this.  I love the background choice in contrast to the black clothing, great lighting as well.  And as for the bow, well, spectacular!  They way you got it to go from narrow on the ends to wider in the middle, nice touch! Too bad no spot editing allowed, I''d get rid of those two dots on the wall, doesn''t that just drive you mad sometimes? :)  9 from me!', '2004-01-29 17:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(562235, 56780, 15242, '<td valign="top">The angle and position makes her foot look huge and I''m sure you know the problem with your background.<br/>I like the idea but this comes off as a woman hiding behind a large vase.</td>', 'The angle and position makes her foot look huge and I''m sure you know the problem with your background.I like the idea but this comes off as a woman hiding behind a large vase.', '2004-01-29 18:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(562236, 57047, 15242, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, beautiful animal, good lighting and very natural colors.  Try cropping it so you just get his face and mane.</td>', 'Nice shot, beautiful animal, good lighting and very natural colors.  Try cropping it so you just get his face and mane.', '2004-01-29 18:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(562237, 57188, 14620, '<td valign="top">Very nice compostion and b&amp;w tones.  Like the light, blurred background against the crispness of your subject.  Also, very good detail on your subject.  Well Done.</td>', 'Very nice compostion and b&w tones.  Like the light, blurred background against the crispness of your subject.  Also, very good detail on your subject.  Well Done.', '2004-01-29 18:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(562242, 56428, 15242, '<td valign="top">Too small, out of focus, and a pretty good stretch to meet the challenge.  It is a very interesting subject and could be a great shot though.  Practice with the macro setting on your camera and try it again.</td>', 'Too small, out of focus, and a pretty good stretch to meet the challenge.  It is a very interesting subject and could be a great shot though.  Practice with the macro setting on your camera and try it again.', '2004-01-29 18:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(562243, 57221, 14620, '<td valign="top">Really like this alot!  Love the lighting and also don''t mind that some detail is lost in the face because I think there''s just enough there to draw you into the picture to really look at it.  Excellent subject!</td>', 'Really like this alot!  Love the lighting and also don''t mind that some detail is lost in the face because I think there''s just enough there to draw you into the picture to really look at it.  Excellent subject!', '2004-01-29 18:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
