(562299, 56652, 7628, '<td valign="top">Awsome horns.  NIce details and color on the goat. I wish the background was even more out of focus, so the goat would stand out even more.</td>', 'Awsome horns.  NIce details and color on the goat. I wish the background was even more out of focus, so the goat would stand out even more.', '2004-01-29 18:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(562301, 57225, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice golden light.  I like that you chose another angle than straight on.  I wish there were better focus.  Even if just the front part were sharp and the rest blurry, that would go well with the title, even the focus would be weighing the options.</td>', 'Nice golden light.  I like that you chose another angle than straight on.  I wish there were better focus.  Even if just the front part were sharp and the rest blurry, that would go well with the title, even the focus would be weighing the options.', '2004-01-29 18:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(562304, 57304, 7628, '<td valign="top">The jug has a wonderful glowing quality to it.  The lightiing is really fantastic.  You caught the water well.  I''d crop in more - lose some of the blackness. 9</td>', 'The jug has a wonderful glowing quality to it.  The lightiing is really fantastic.  You caught the water well.  I''d crop in more - lose some of the blackness. 9', '2004-01-29 19:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(562305, 56780, 8860, '<td valign="top">Why hide what looks like an appealing subject? Hiding her face actually spoils this composition and the foot in the foreground looks artificially large due to foreshortening! Aside from that I think it has the makings of a good shot, but I feel the absence of water means the link is tenuous and the weak composition replaced by soft focus technique.</td>', 'Why hide what looks like an appealing subject? Hiding her face actually spoils this composition and the foot in the foreground looks artificially large due to foreshortening! Aside from that I think it has the makings of a good shot, but I feel the absence of water means the link is tenuous and the weak composition replaced by soft focus technique.', '2004-01-29 19:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(562307, 57323, 7628, '<td valign="top">nicely caught ripples.  The symbol is pretty sharp too.  The ripples are so subtle compared to the hard, shiny metal, that some of the impact is lost.  Perhaps b&amp;w or monottone would balance this out?</td>', 'nicely caught ripples.  The symbol is pretty sharp too.  The ripples are so subtle compared to the hard, shiny metal, that some of the impact is lost.  Perhaps b&w or monottone would balance this out?', '2004-01-29 19:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
