(562657, 57272, 10084, '<td valign="top">More depth of field would really help the lions stand out from the background. Currently blends in too much with the background. Gaussian blur would help to bring the lions out also.</td>', 'More depth of field would really help the lions stand out from the background. Currently blends in too much with the background. Gaussian blur would help to bring the lions out also.', '2004-01-29 23:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(562716, 57181, 9027, '<td valign="top">quality of photo not good, very pixelly. would have been better taken with natural lighting, not a flash. the flash washes out the colors and caused ''red'' eye.  image also very blurry, and well, he could really use a mane to bring him closer to being leo-ish. :P overall, the execution is off and the way the subject matter was handled does not capture interest.</td>', 'quality of photo not good, very pixelly. would have been better taken with natural lighting, not a flash. the flash washes out the colors and caused ''red'' eye.  image also very blurry, and well, he could really use a mane to bring him closer to being leo-ish. :P overall, the execution is off and the way the subject matter was handled does not capture interest.', '2004-01-30 00:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
