(562725, 56554, 16255, '<td valign="top">Somewhat washed out.  I''d like to have seen a more distinctively clean glass vase with crisper reflections and more deeply colored stalks and leaves.  As is, it''s difficult to tell if it''s just the water that''s cloudy, or the glass and the water that''s murky and dull.</td>', 'Somewhat washed out.  I''d like to have seen a more distinctively clean glass vase with crisper reflections and more deeply colored stalks and leaves.  As is, it''s difficult to tell if it''s just the water that''s cloudy, or the glass and the water that''s murky and dull.', '2004-01-30 01:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(562727, 57299, 16255, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Great reflection of the fiery sun on the water with the waves gently washing the shore and the bird balancing out the weight of the reflection.  Love the contrast of the sun as it bleeds out through the clouds to skim over the waves to the shore.</td>', 'Nice.  Great reflection of the fiery sun on the water with the waves gently washing the shore and the bird balancing out the weight of the reflection.  Love the contrast of the sun as it bleeds out through the clouds to skim over the waves to the shore.', '2004-01-30 01:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
