(562839, 56650, 15920, '<td valign="top">Nice Portrait.  All of the technical points are good (focus, depth of field, etc.)  The other thing that was interesting about this is that this is a much better picture than I expected when I scanned the thumbnails (not sure why.)  One small comment: the background is a little distracting, both with pattern and the line where it joins the wall, but overall,great portrait.</td>', 'Nice Portrait.  All of the technical points are good (focus, depth of field, etc.)  The other thing that was interesting about this is that this is a much better picture than I expected when I scanned the thumbnails (not sure why.)  One small comment: the background is a little distracting, both with pattern and the line where it joins the wall, but overall,great portrait.', '2004-01-30 06:14:27.000000', NULL, 1);
