(563224, 56711, 3087, '<td valign="top">What great "texture" to that background - nice mix of tones in it too.<br/>Arrow is sharp and well positioned - but feels a little wonky. Doesn''t detract for me though.</td>', 'What great "texture" to that background - nice mix of tones in it too.Arrow is sharp and well positioned - but feels a little wonky. Doesn''t detract for me though.', '2004-01-30 15:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(563240, 57265, 3087, '<td valign="top">Good choice to opt for close up - filling the frame can certainly add more interest to an everyday subject.</td>', 'Good choice to opt for close up - filling the frame can certainly add more interest to an everyday subject.', '2004-01-30 15:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(563242, 56983, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the image and the angle but am missing the connection with the challenge, even having read the title several times. Hence, it fails in terms of conveying the theme to me.</td>', 'I like the image and the angle but am missing the connection with the challenge, even having read the title several times. Hence, it fails in terms of conveying the theme to me.', '2004-01-30 15:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(563245, 57301, 3087, '<td valign="top">I''d prefer this to be either a true silhouette or to have fill in light that allows me to see the detail of the subject. This feels like it''s randomly stuck in between the two. Pose and composition are OK, but lighting is the main problem for me.</td>', 'I''d prefer this to be either a true silhouette or to have fill in light that allows me to see the detail of the subject. This feels like it''s randomly stuck in between the two. Pose and composition are OK, but lighting is the main problem for me.', '2004-01-30 15:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(563249, 57217, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice set of scales and I think the choice of black and white with toning brings out the detail. Lighting is somewhat uneven, perhaps softening it by putting a sheet or tissue infront of the light source might help. I''d also consider using a large sheet of card, curved to provide both surface and backdrop, to remove lines and remove background detail more effectively.</td>', 'Nice set of scales and I think the choice of black and white with toning brings out the detail. Lighting is somewhat uneven, perhaps softening it by putting a sheet or tissue infront of the light source might help. I''d also consider using a large sheet of card, curved to provide both surface and backdrop, to remove lines and remove background detail more effectively.', '2004-01-30 15:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(563251, 56468, 3087, '<td valign="top">Not sure of the zodiac link but like the image - corner composition works well for me.</td>', 'Not sure of the zodiac link but like the image - corner composition works well for me.', '2004-01-30 15:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(563262, 56650, 3087, '<td valign="top">A lovely, informal portrait with wonderful eye contact. Could do with a touch of fill-in light on her face but only a touch.</td>', 'A lovely, informal portrait with wonderful eye contact. Could do with a touch of fill-in light on her face but only a touch.', '2004-01-30 16:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(563263, 57178, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great idea! The pose makes for an interesting composition and the interplay of light and shadow is fascinating. Focus/ image quality let it down.</td>', 'Great idea! The pose makes for an interesting composition and the interplay of light and shadow is fascinating. Focus/ image quality let it down.', '2004-01-30 16:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(563264, 56722, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great eye contact and I really like the blurred geometric background. Feels too tightly cropped at left and right side for my tastes. Nice image though.</td>', 'Great eye contact and I really like the blurred geometric background. Feels too tightly cropped at left and right side for my tastes. Nice image though.', '2004-01-30 16:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(563265, 56229, 3087, '<td valign="top">Though the shadow isn''t too strong to allow detail to show clearly the light does fall most strongly on her upper torso - which pulls my focus away from her face to a less interesting part of the image.<br/>I like composition and background.</td>', 'Though the shadow isn''t too strong to allow detail to show clearly the light does fall most strongly on her upper torso - which pulls my focus away from her face to a less interesting part of the image.I like composition and background.', '2004-01-30 16:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(563267, 57323, 3087, '<td valign="top">Simple, strong colours, and strong composition.</td>', 'Simple, strong colours, and strong composition.', '2004-01-30 16:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(563269, 57193, 3087, '<td valign="top">I see the lion but the photo just doesn''t hold much appeal.<br/>That said it does bring to mind night time dreams and nightmares of shadows and monsters.</td>', 'I see the lion but the photo just doesn''t hold much appeal.That said it does bring to mind night time dreams and nightmares of shadows and monsters.', '2004-01-30 16:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(563271, 56780, 3087, '<td valign="top">Too soft focus for my tastes and lighting too strong. Interesting pose and props though.</td>', 'Too soft focus for my tastes and lighting too strong. Interesting pose and props though.', '2004-01-30 16:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(563274, 56938, 3087, '<td valign="top">A little too dark for me and composition doesn''t really feels balanced.</td>', 'A little too dark for me and composition doesn''t really feels balanced.', '2004-01-30 16:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(563275, 56811, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting low angle but focus seems very soft.</td>', 'Interesting low angle but focus seems very soft.', '2004-01-30 16:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(563276, 57123, 3087, '<td valign="top">-<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-03-22 04:17:04.</i></td>', '-', '2004-01-30 16:15:28.000000', '2004-03-22 04:17:04.000000', 1),
(563277, 57203, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting backlighting.</td>', 'Interesting backlighting.', '2004-01-30 16:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(563278, 57251, 3087, '<td valign="top">Too soft for me (but I''m not a fan of that soft focus effect in portraits) and lighting is too strong... though that does support the angelic, virginal theme so it''s not necessarily a bad thing.</td>', 'Too soft for me (but I''m not a fan of that soft focus effect in portraits) and lighting is too strong... though that does support the angelic, virginal theme so it''s not necessarily a bad thing.', '2004-01-30 16:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(563281, 56925, 3087, '<td valign="top">Not enough interest overall in the image - it''s more like a snapshot of an incident of environmental graffiti than an artistic interpretation of the scene by a photographer.</td>', 'Not enough interest overall in the image - it''s more like a snapshot of an incident of environmental graffiti than an artistic interpretation of the scene by a photographer.', '2004-01-30 16:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(563283, 56554, 3087, '<td valign="top">Colours too faded and insipid for me. Composition is interesting. The wavy lines are not really attention grabbing enough.</td>', 'Colours too faded and insipid for me. Composition is interesting. The wavy lines are not really attention grabbing enough.', '2004-01-30 16:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(563284, 57242, 3087, '<td valign="top">Certainly includes an image related to the zodiac but the image itself holds no appeal for me - it just doesn''t have anything to pull me in to it in it''s own right.</td>', 'Certainly includes an image related to the zodiac but the image itself holds no appeal for me - it just doesn''t have anything to pull me in to it in it''s own right.', '2004-01-30 16:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(563285, 57223, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great idea but composition of droplets doesn''t feel balanced. Clear droplets overpower the blue ones, which I assume, from their relevant pattern, are the intended focal point.</td>', 'Great idea but composition of droplets doesn''t feel balanced. Clear droplets overpower the blue ones, which I assume, from their relevant pattern, are the intended focal point.', '2004-01-30 16:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(563287, 56800, 3087, '<td valign="top">Is there any link between M&amp;Ms and water or are they just handy blue spheres (in which case I''d have hidden the logos). A little wonky in the layout and I don''t find them well positioned within the frame. This one just lacks punch for me.</td>', 'Is there any link between M&Ms and water or are they just handy blue spheres (in which case I''d have hidden the logos). A little wonky in the layout and I don''t find them well positioned within the frame. This one just lacks punch for me.', '2004-01-30 16:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(563288, 56815, 3087, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title at all. With the head being twisted away the image fails to hold appeal or interest for me.</td>', 'I don''t get the title at all. With the head being twisted away the image fails to hold appeal or interest for me.', '2004-01-30 16:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(563289, 56428, 3087, '<td valign="top">Too small, seems to be out of focus (though hard to tell at this size). Not sure how it relates to Libra - that''s about balance between two items or concepts or decisions or contrasts or personalities... rather than being able to stay upright!<br/></td>', 'Too small, seems to be out of focus (though hard to tell at this size). Not sure how it relates to Libra - that''s about balance between two items or concepts or decisions or contrasts or personalities... rather than being able to stay upright!', '2004-01-30 16:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(563290, 57272, 3087, '<td valign="top">I see the link to the challenge strongly but the image itself lacks interest for me - there is nothing to draw me in aside from the fact that there are lions and the challenge includes leo/ lion.</td>', 'I see the link to the challenge strongly but the image itself lacks interest for me - there is nothing to draw me in aside from the fact that there are lions and the challenge includes leo/ lion.', '2004-01-30 16:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(563292, 56848, 3087, '<td valign="top">Light is very harsh and this means a loss in detail in the fur of the seated one. Lacks wow factor - background a little dull.</td>', 'Light is very harsh and this means a loss in detail in the fur of the seated one. Lacks wow factor - background a little dull.', '2004-01-30 16:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(563295, 57288, 3087, '<td valign="top">Out of focus, no eye contact to draw me in, poor lighting, dull background.</td>', 'Out of focus, no eye contact to draw me in, poor lighting, dull background.', '2004-01-30 16:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(563297, 57031, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lighting and focus too poor to allow the details to appeal. Composition seems completely haphazard.</td>', 'Lighting and focus too poor to allow the details to appeal. Composition seems completely haphazard.', '2004-01-30 16:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(563298, 57198, 3087, '<td valign="top">Composition unbalanced (top heavy), Focus poor, content not particurly fascinating.</td>', 'Composition unbalanced (top heavy), Focus poor, content not particurly fascinating.', '2004-01-30 16:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(563300, 57150, 3087, '<td valign="top">Inverting just doesn''t add interest to an image without much visual interest (to me).</td>', 'Inverting just doesn''t add interest to an image without much visual interest (to me).', '2004-01-30 16:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(563301, 57094, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems harsh. Lacks focal point. Little to hold my interest.</td>', 'Lighting seems harsh. Lacks focal point. Little to hold my interest.', '2004-01-30 16:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(563305, 57268, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great viewpoint, angle and tight crop make this one of my top 5. I think that photos of ornaments can so often result in what are merely windows to someone else''s creativity but when these are photographed and presented creatively (as here) they show imagination on the part of the photographer too.</td>', 'Great viewpoint, angle and tight crop make this one of my top 5. I think that photos of ornaments can so often result in what are merely windows to someone else''s creativity but when these are photographed and presented creatively (as here) they show imagination on the part of the photographer too.', '2004-01-30 16:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(563308, 57243, 3087, '<td valign="top">What an intriguing composition and lighting too. I like this very much and that''s not even related to my being a Libra since I don''t believe in the zodiac whatsoever. 10</td>', 'What an intriguing composition and lighting too. I like this very much and that''s not even related to my being a Libra since I don''t believe in the zodiac whatsoever. 10', '2004-01-30 16:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(563309, 57208, 3087, '<td valign="top">Composition is fantastic! The exact line of the jaw and neck against the slope of the shoulder is very strong - I love the shape and the shadows created.<br/>The position of the fish within the frame is just right. The visual balance in this shot feels so strong that it just keeps me staring. I also like the orange tone and the high grain.<br/>10</td>', 'Composition is fantastic! The exact line of the jaw and neck against the slope of the shoulder is very strong - I love the shape and the shadows created.The position of the fish within the frame is just right. The visual balance in this shot feels so strong that it just keeps me staring. I also like the orange tone and the high grain.10', '2004-01-30 16:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(563311, 57218, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow - very creative - red lighting and that wonderful "bow and arrow" are wonderful!<br/>One of my top 5.</td>', 'Wow - very creative - red lighting and that wonderful "bow and arrow" are wonderful!One of my top 5.', '2004-01-30 16:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(563312, 57110, 3087, '<td valign="top">I have looked and looked and I just don''t get the message/ concept.<br/>Though I''m starting to entertain thoughts of virgins in chastity belts being burned at the stake!!<br/>I do really like the image and would be interested to learn what your idea/ challenge interpretation is.<br/>Great diagonal and wonderful mix of red, yellow, bronze and black. <br/>Visually highly appealing and very enigmatic.<br/>One of my top 5.</td>', 'I have looked and looked and I just don''t get the message/ concept.Though I''m starting to entertain thoughts of virgins in chastity belts being burned at the stake!!I do really like the image and would be interested to learn what your idea/ challenge interpretation is.Great diagonal and wonderful mix of red, yellow, bronze and black. Visually highly appealing and very enigmatic.One of my top 5.', '2004-01-30 16:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(563319, 57087, 3087, '<td valign="top">Only the title links this to the challenge in any way. The image itself fails to convey the theme completely. It also lacks visual interest for me - no focal point and no unusual composition (from cloud shapes etc) either.</td>', 'Only the title links this to the challenge in any way. The image itself fails to convey the theme completely. It also lacks visual interest for me - no focal point and no unusual composition (from cloud shapes etc) either.', '2004-01-30 16:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(563320, 57305, 3087, '<td valign="top">Too small and focus is really too poor to make this worth looking at. The kind of snapshot that''s probably mainly of interest to the people in it and their friends/ family. That said, eye contact is good - if it were in focus and larger that would really help pull viewers in.</td>', 'Too small and focus is really too poor to make this worth looking at. The kind of snapshot that''s probably mainly of interest to the people in it and their friends/ family. That said, eye contact is good - if it were in focus and larger that would really help pull viewers in.', '2004-01-30 16:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(563322, 57047, 15982, '<td valign="top">Great Picture! I feel like you could have cropped just the head of the lion. But a classic shot!</td>', 'Great Picture! I feel like you could have cropped just the head of the lion. But a classic shot!', '2004-01-30 16:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(563323, 57204, 15982, '<td valign="top">Nice color and detail on this shot!</td>', 'Nice color and detail on this shot!', '2004-01-30 16:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(563325, 57267, 15982, '<td valign="top">The colors portray a strong emotion, but (being picky) the face is lit up a little too much and contrasts too much with the rest of the picture. I think it should be the focal point, but not as much light. Good luck!</td>', 'The colors portray a strong emotion, but (being picky) the face is lit up a little too much and contrasts too much with the rest of the picture. I think it should be the focal point, but not as much light. Good luck!', '2004-01-30 16:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(563331, 57030, 15982, '<td valign="top">Great colors. Very symetrical composition as well. I''m not so much for the near perfect set up, but I won''t degrade points because of my opinion on pictures. Godd luck! 7</td>', 'Great colors. Very symetrical composition as well. I''m not so much for the near perfect set up, but I won''t degrade points because of my opinion on pictures. Godd luck! 7', '2004-01-30 16:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(563332, 57272, 15982, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. (my opinion) The overall mood of the shot doesn''t fit the title to me for some reason - I guess I envision a greeting with a warmer setting. I think it is the overcast light or something. But I still like it. 7</td>', 'Nice picture. (my opinion) The overall mood of the shot doesn''t fit the title to me for some reason - I guess I envision a greeting with a warmer setting. I think it is the overcast light or something. But I still like it. 7', '2004-01-30 16:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(563335, 57221, 15982, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of the silhouette, but the trees in the background kind of detract from it. Adds complexity to a simplistic subject. Only my opinion though. Good luck!</td>', 'I like the simplicity of the silhouette, but the trees in the background kind of detract from it. Adds complexity to a simplistic subject. Only my opinion though. Good luck!', '2004-01-30 16:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(563338, 57243, 15982, '<td valign="top">This is a great picture! I love the shadows and the soft colors. All of the curves add to the soft mood of the picture as well. Some people may be picky and want a darker shadow, but I think it is perfect for the picture! And instead of framing an unmistakable subject, you chose to use hints as to what it is. Nice - 10</td>', 'This is a great picture! I love the shadows and the soft colors. All of the curves add to the soft mood of the picture as well. Some people may be picky and want a darker shadow, but I think it is perfect for the picture! And instead of framing an unmistakable subject, you chose to use hints as to what it is. Nice - 10', '2004-01-30 17:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(563340, 57131, 15982, '<td valign="top">The blue just takes over the picture. This would have been much better, in my opinion, if it had either a softer background, or less light. Good luck!</td>', 'The blue just takes over the picture. This would have been much better, in my opinion, if it had either a softer background, or less light. Good luck!', '2004-01-30 17:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(563343, 57275, 15982, '<td valign="top">I love it! There is maybe TOO much going on in the picture, but what an incredible shot! Good luck!</td>', 'I love it! There is maybe TOO much going on in the picture, but what an incredible shot! Good luck!', '2004-01-30 17:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(563344, 56811, 15982, '<td valign="top">Go Scorpios! One of the few who chose to tackle the challenge of taking a picture of a scorpio. Good luck!</td>', 'Go Scorpios! One of the few who chose to tackle the challenge of taking a picture of a scorpio. Good luck!', '2004-01-30 17:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(563346, 57165, 15982, '<td valign="top">Great statue! Too much contrast from statue to the background though. And the shadow is a bit distracting. I think this shot may have looked better closer to mid day light to better highlight the curves of his body and shine down on the mane. Then again, I may not know what I am talking about, rarely do!!! Good luck!</td>', 'Great statue! Too much contrast from statue to the background though. And the shadow is a bit distracting. I think this shot may have looked better closer to mid day light to better highlight the curves of his body and shine down on the mane. Then again, I may not know what I am talking about, rarely do!!! Good luck!', '2004-01-30 17:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(563348, 56663, 15982, '<td valign="top">Amusing! Good detail too. Good luck!</td>', 'Amusing! Good detail too. Good luck!', '2004-01-30 17:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(563350, 56938, 15982, '<td valign="top">This could maybe be a little lighter, or possibly a faint blue, or hint of blue in the background. Good luck!</td>', 'This could maybe be a little lighter, or possibly a faint blue, or hint of blue in the background. Good luck!', '2004-01-30 17:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(563352, 57221, 3087, '<td valign="top">Mmm Goat on a stick!<br/>I think it needs some fill in light to bring out the skull detail BUT I really like the halo effect of the backlighting which you wouldn''t want to lose. <br/>Basically it''s just that the shape of the goat on a stick silhouette doesn''t really appeal so much to me as a shape...</td>', 'Mmm Goat on a stick!I think it needs some fill in light to bring out the skull detail BUT I really like the halo effect of the backlighting which you wouldn''t want to lose. Basically it''s just that the shape of the goat on a stick silhouette doesn''t really appeal so much to me as a shape...', '2004-01-30 17:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(563355, 56498, 15982, '<td valign="top">I would have voted this much higher with a better light source. I really like this picture. There is a little bit of movement, not perfectly straight, and strange shadows - all things that people will probably be picky about. But I LIKE them. The only thing I am not much for is the overabundance of yellow/orange. Good luck!! 8</td>', 'I would have voted this much higher with a better light source. I really like this picture. There is a little bit of movement, not perfectly straight, and strange shadows - all things that people will probably be picky about. But I LIKE them. The only thing I am not much for is the overabundance of yellow/orange. Good luck!! 8', '2004-01-30 17:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(563356, 56828, 15982, '<td valign="top">Great detail! Nice shot, I know it isn''t easy to get this good of a shot of the moon. Good job!</td>', 'Great detail! Nice shot, I know it isn''t easy to get this good of a shot of the moon. Good job!', '2004-01-30 17:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(563359, 56925, 15982, '<td valign="top">Maybe a tad overexposed, and the border kind of adds to that. Good luck!</td>', 'Maybe a tad overexposed, and the border kind of adds to that. Good luck!', '2004-01-30 17:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(563361, 57223, 15982, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. I like it!</td>', 'Interesting shot. I like it!', '2004-01-30 17:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(563364, 57218, 12095, '<td valign="top">Great Picture!  Very creative!  Awesome light effect.  Could have done well in Painting with Light challenge too.  My favorites in this challenge!  Should win 1st Place!</td>', 'Great Picture!  Very creative!  Awesome light effect.  Could have done well in Painting with Light challenge too.  My favorites in this challenge!  Should win 1st Place!', '2004-01-30 17:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(563365, 57248, 14211, '<td valign="top">interesting</td>', 'interesting', '2004-01-30 17:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(563370, 57268, 15982, '<td valign="top">I think this may look really good in sepia tones. Good luck!</td>', 'I think this may look really good in sepia tones. Good luck!', '2004-01-30 17:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(563371, 56575, 15982, '<td valign="top">Awesome lighting! Maybe could have used one more very soft light to illuminate the right side of the face a little more. But the body, legs, feet, and background are amazing! 9</td>', 'Awesome lighting! Maybe could have used one more very soft light to illuminate the right side of the face a little more. But the body, legs, feet, and background are amazing! 9', '2004-01-30 17:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(563374, 57298, 15982, '<td valign="top">Far too much light and there is a little bit of motion. A picture like this would look better centered more too. Just my opinion. Good luck!</td>', 'Far too much light and there is a little bit of motion. A picture like this would look better centered more too. Just my opinion. Good luck!', '2004-01-30 17:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(563376, 56726, 15982, '<td valign="top">Really cool picture! Good luck!</td>', 'Really cool picture! Good luck!', '2004-01-30 17:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(563378, 57189, 15982, '<td valign="top">Cool idea. I think the constellations should have been the focal point, and blur the earth globe a little bit. But great idea!</td>', 'Cool idea. I think the constellations should have been the focal point, and blur the earth globe a little bit. But great idea!', '2004-01-30 17:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(563382, 57025, 15982, '<td valign="top">Nice detail! Good luck</td>', 'Nice detail! Good luck', '2004-01-30 17:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(563383, 57181, 15982, '<td valign="top">Good luck!</td>', 'Good luck!', '2004-01-30 17:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(563386, 57159, 15982, '<td valign="top">This person did an excellent job posing for this picture! I really like it! Good luck! 8</td>', 'This person did an excellent job posing for this picture! I really like it! Good luck! 8', '2004-01-30 17:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(563387, 57304, 15982, '<td valign="top">I think a tighter crop would look better, but an excellent shot! Good luck!</td>', 'I think a tighter crop would look better, but an excellent shot! Good luck!', '2004-01-30 17:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(563389, 56709, 15982, '<td valign="top">Cool picture. Kind of eerie and gloomy. Good luck!</td>', 'Cool picture. Kind of eerie and gloomy. Good luck!', '2004-01-30 17:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(563391, 56800, 15982, '<td valign="top">I have to ask, why the one green m&amp;m?</td>', 'I have to ask, why the one green m&m?', '2004-01-30 17:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(563392, 57031, 16053, '<td valign="top">I think it could be a great shot with agreat motive... if it wasen''t so out of focus and blur.</td>', 'I think it could be a great shot with agreat motive... if it wasen''t so out of focus and blur.', '2004-01-30 17:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(563399, 57159, 16053, '<td valign="top">This is what I call a good motive photo. Simple but keeping the objective in mind.</td>', 'This is what I call a good motive photo. Simple but keeping the objective in mind.', '2004-01-30 17:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(563400, 56988, 15982, '<td valign="top">Where is the horns?</td>', 'Where is the horns?', '2004-01-30 17:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(563402, 56275, 15982, '<td valign="top">This would be a cool painting with light pic. Actually... I think I saw something similar there too. Good luck - nice shot!</td>', 'This would be a cool painting with light pic. Actually... I think I saw something similar there too. Good luck - nice shot!', '2004-01-30 17:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(563405, 57242, 16053, '<td valign="top">Excelent motive</td>', 'Excelent motive', '2004-01-30 17:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(563407, 57289, 15982, '<td valign="top">Eerie background! nice picture! Good luck with the challenge!</td>', 'Eerie background! nice picture! Good luck with the challenge!', '2004-01-30 17:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(563408, 57279, 15982, '<td valign="top">I feel like a tad more light would have done great here! Good picture though.</td>', 'I feel like a tad more light would have done great here! Good picture though.', '2004-01-30 17:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(563411, 56722, 15982, '<td valign="top">That''s one overweight goat!</td>', 'That''s one overweight goat!', '2004-01-30 17:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(563413, 57261, 15982, '<td valign="top">Great find! This is an awesome take! I hope to see it at the top! 10</td>', 'Great find! This is an awesome take! I hope to see it at the top! 10', '2004-01-30 17:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(563414, 57095, 15982, '<td valign="top">I like this picture. What did you use for the sign? I love this statue! Good luck!</td>', 'I like this picture. What did you use for the sign? I love this statue! Good luck!', '2004-01-30 17:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(563416, 57251, 15982, '<td valign="top">Nice color and overall mood!</td>', 'Nice color and overall mood!', '2004-01-30 17:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(563417, 57217, 11241, '<td valign="top">Well done, fits the Challenge great!  I am a Libra...those scales are very nice looking are they old...?  the only thing I would have changed would be the edge of the Table is a bit out of place.  But that is just me....I give you a 10</td>', 'Well done, fits the Challenge great!  I am a Libra...those scales are very nice looking are they old...?  the only thing I would have changed would be the edge of the Table is a bit out of place.  But that is just me....I give you a 10', '2004-01-30 17:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(563420, 57218, 11241, '<td valign="top">WOW how it you do that.....I think it is great!  ....9</td>', 'WOW how it you do that.....I think it is great!  ....9', '2004-01-30 17:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(563422, 57297, 15982, '<td valign="top">This picture has to be one of the funniest I have ever seen!! Very good color detail too. Nice! 9</td>', 'This picture has to be one of the funniest I have ever seen!! Very good color detail too. Nice! 9', '2004-01-30 17:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(563423, 57273, 11241, '<td valign="top">The backgound is a little to much for me, but I like the simple things the best....if it was on a white background it would have gotten a 10 with me.....9</td>', 'The backgound is a little to much for me, but I like the simple things the best....if it was on a white background it would have gotten a 10 with me.....9', '2004-01-30 18:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(563424, 56229, 15982, '<td valign="top">Great take! This is a wonderful picture! Good luck!</td>', 'Great take! This is a wonderful picture! Good luck!', '2004-01-30 18:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(563464, 57252, 16695, '<td valign="top">Oddly overexposed, but it provides a sort of mysticism.</td>', 'Oddly overexposed, but it provides a sort of mysticism.', '2004-01-30 19:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(563476, 57282, 15982, '<td valign="top">I don''t really understand your picture. If you don''t mind explaining it to me, and how it relates to the zodiac signs, I will revote on it.<br/> <br/>Thanks for the reply and story behind the picture - good luck!<br/>BTW, the texture is really awesome. 7</td>', 'I don''t really understand your picture. If you don''t mind explaining it to me, and how it relates to the zodiac signs, I will revote on it. Thanks for the reply and story behind the picture - good luck!BTW, the texture is really awesome. 7', '2004-01-30 19:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(563480, 57274, 10818, '<td valign="top">Very good photo.  the green gives it color, and makes it easiier to see.  But not really the color of water.  I hope its not voted down too much for that.</td>', 'Very good photo.  the green gives it color, and makes it easiier to see.  But not really the color of water.  I hope its not voted down too much for that.', '2004-01-30 19:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(563491, 57218, 15982, '<td valign="top">Great picture! This would have done excellent in the painting with light challenge too! Awesome idea!!! Great colors and wall texture. Good luck! 9</td>', 'Great picture! This would have done excellent in the painting with light challenge too! Awesome idea!!! Great colors and wall texture. Good luck! 9', '2004-01-30 19:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(563492, 56711, 15982, '<td valign="top">I have to know, was this shot actually taken with the arrow in motion?<br/>Great picture none the less! Good luck</td>', 'I have to know, was this shot actually taken with the arrow in motion?Great picture none the less! Good luck', '2004-01-30 19:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(563493, 56748, 15982, '<td valign="top">This could have used a better light source - I''m not much at all for camera flash. The multi-color is a bit distracting, and the picture is very noisy (ISO too high). May have looked better in b&amp;w or sepia. A better cropping job could have been used to even out the top portion of the picture too. Good luck!</td>', 'This could have used a better light source - I''m not much at all for camera flash. The multi-color is a bit distracting, and the picture is very noisy (ISO too high). May have looked better in b&w or sepia. A better cropping job could have been used to even out the top portion of the picture too. Good luck!', '2004-01-30 19:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(563494, 56468, 15982, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but I don''t really get your picture. Maybe you can send me a PM and tell me more about it, but I don''t see anything to do with zodiac in it. It is a nice picture, but I don''t feel that it meets the challenge. I don''t know a whole lot about zodiac signs and meanings behind them, so maybe I am mistaking. If you can give a bit of info on it, I will revote.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but I don''t really get your picture. Maybe you can send me a PM and tell me more about it, but I don''t see anything to do with zodiac in it. It is a nice picture, but I don''t feel that it meets the challenge. I don''t know a whole lot about zodiac signs and meanings behind them, so maybe I am mistaking. If you can give a bit of info on it, I will revote.', '2004-01-30 19:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(563508, 57122, 15330, '<td valign="top">The colors are really great against the dark background. I also like that the fish go diagonally across the frame, and not horizontally. Good job</td>', 'The colors are really great against the dark background. I also like that the fish go diagonally across the frame, and not horizontally. Good job', '2004-01-30 20:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(563509, 56814, 15330, '<td valign="top">The water bottles look a little out of focus. I do like the symetry in the photo.</td>', 'The water bottles look a little out of focus. I do like the symetry in the photo.', '2004-01-30 20:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(563512, 57090, 15330, '<td valign="top">This is great, it really shows the movement and power of water. I think that it is a little out of focus, or the shutter wasn''t fast enough.</td>', 'This is great, it really shows the movement and power of water. I think that it is a little out of focus, or the shutter wasn''t fast enough.', '2004-01-30 20:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(563514, 57192, 15330, '<td valign="top">Looks out of focus.</td>', 'Looks out of focus.', '2004-01-30 20:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(563517, 57218, 13937, '<td valign="top">Nice light painting!  The only thing I would have changed is the background.  I would like to see more red in it and more separation from the subject.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice light painting!  The only thing I would have changed is the background.  I would like to see more red in it and more separation from the subject.  Well done.', '2004-01-30 20:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(563518, 57297, 15330, '<td valign="top">Very funny, great job. But asthetically there isn''t much that stands out.</td>', 'Very funny, great job. But asthetically there isn''t much that stands out.', '2004-01-30 20:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(563520, 56275, 13937, '<td valign="top">Nice placement of the double exposure.  The lighting has a sinister look about it.  Nice job.</td>', 'Nice placement of the double exposure.  The lighting has a sinister look about it.  Nice job.', '2004-01-30 20:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(563521, 57225, 15330, '<td valign="top">Improve the focus to make this better. The cloth in the background is too distracting, try having a plain black background.</td>', 'Improve the focus to make this better. The cloth in the background is too distracting, try having a plain black background.', '2004-01-30 20:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(563523, 57188, 13937, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and separation from the background.  A different time of day may have been helpful, though. A little more shadow in the right places would give you more depth.</td>', 'Nice composition and separation from the background.  A different time of day may have been helpful, though. A little more shadow in the right places would give you more depth.', '2004-01-30 20:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(563524, 57267, 13937, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  The light appears to be a little strong on the person in the image, though.  If she''s toned down, you''ll draw more attention to the writing.  Seems a bit distracting.</td>', 'Nice idea.  The light appears to be a little strong on the person in the image, though.  If she''s toned down, you''ll draw more attention to the writing.  Seems a bit distracting.', '2004-01-30 20:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(563529, 57307, 15330, '<td valign="top">Try it with a smaller aperture, the tail is out of focus, while the head is in focus. I don''t know might have been your intent, but I think it would look better with the whole thing in focus. I also think that the white at the bottom of the picture is a little distracting.</td>', 'Try it with a smaller aperture, the tail is out of focus, while the head is in focus. I don''t know might have been your intent, but I think it would look better with the whole thing in focus. I also think that the white at the bottom of the picture is a little distracting.', '2004-01-30 20:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(563530, 57272, 15330, '<td valign="top">The background is too busy for my taste. But the lions do look great.</td>', 'The background is too busy for my taste. But the lions do look great.', '2004-01-30 20:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(563537, 57257, 327, '<td valign="top">Ho''s.....? This just left me wondering.  I did a google and a dictionary search. Then I thought he means hose, but ran out of room. I hope that''s the answer. The shot isn''t bad. However the  title, modern watch/belt and extinguisher don''t go together in my opinion. What I do like is the perspective, tone and lighting. Good luck in the challenge.<br/></td>', 'Ho''s.....? This just left me wondering.  I did a google and a dictionary search. Then I thought he means hose, but ran out of room. I hope that''s the answer. The shot isn''t bad. However the  title, modern watch/belt and extinguisher don''t go together in my opinion. What I do like is the perspective, tone and lighting. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-01-30 20:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(563538, 56468, 15330, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this relates to the topic.</td>', 'Not sure how this relates to the topic.', '2004-01-30 20:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(563539, 57307, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field. Very nice detail and focus. Very vibrant yellow color with the black background really helps the subject pop out of the shot.</td>', 'Great depth of field. Very nice detail and focus. Very vibrant yellow color with the black background really helps the subject pop out of the shot.', '2004-01-30 20:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(563540, 57208, 327, '<td valign="top">Real tats? LOL Interesting and different. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Real tats? LOL Interesting and different. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-01-30 20:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(563541, 57305, 15330, '<td valign="top">Too small, and out of focus.</td>', 'Too small, and out of focus.', '2004-01-30 21:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(563542, 57058, 327, '<td valign="top">I''m tempted to say the boarder doesn''t work, but don''t dislike it. The colors are good in the Chinatown banner. I feel the whole shot is leaning and that does bother the eye. Anyway it''s clear, clean and in focus. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''m tempted to say the boarder doesn''t work, but don''t dislike it. The colors are good in the Chinatown banner. I feel the whole shot is leaning and that does bother the eye. Anyway it''s clear, clean and in focus. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-01-30 21:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(563544, 56848, 327, '<td valign="top">Good find. Too bad the bush is blocking the sailboat.  The grass and the black and white goat look a bit over sharpened.  Sure nice looking, healthy goats. I like them but they can be cantankerous beasts. Looks like a great area to shoot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Good find. Too bad the bush is blocking the sailboat.  The grass and the black and white goat look a bit over sharpened.  Sure nice looking, healthy goats. I like them but they can be cantankerous beasts. Looks like a great area to shoot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-01-30 21:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(563546, 56709, 10084, '<td valign="top">At first I thought it was an animals'' eye. I looked at the title and looked at the shot again and finally saw what it was.  The way that the water is flowing makes it seem very much like a painting. Kind of interesting actually. "8"</td>', 'At first I thought it was an animals'' eye. I looked at the title and looked at the shot again and finally saw what it was.  The way that the water is flowing makes it seem very much like a painting. Kind of interesting actually. "8"', '2004-01-30 21:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(563547, 57298, 327, '<td valign="top">The subject is on target for the challenge. I do think some levels adjustment would help your white be white. The focus is soft, maybe hand held? Try a tripod if you can, even the little table top tripods are good. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The subject is on target for the challenge. I do think some levels adjustment would help your white be white. The focus is soft, maybe hand held? Try a tripod if you can, even the little table top tripods are good. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-01-30 21:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(563570, 57248, 10084, '<td valign="top">A bit too much exposure. Maybe changing to a B&amp;W would bring out the surface of the rock a bit more. You can see some of the textures you were able to get on the bottom of the shot. Composition is interesting.</td>', 'A bit too much exposure. Maybe changing to a B&W would bring out the surface of the rock a bit more. You can see some of the textures you were able to get on the bottom of the shot. Composition is interesting.', '2004-01-30 21:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(563572, 57242, 10084, '<td valign="top">Composition is good. Getting the bottom of the building helps to give context to the crab. The title just makes me crack up. Great find.</td>', 'Composition is good. Getting the bottom of the building helps to give context to the crab. The title just makes me crack up. Great find.', '2004-01-30 21:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(563575, 57305, 10084, '<td valign="top">Composition is good with the diagonal line from eye to eye and the cheeks, Unfortunate too blurry. Also downloading a larger file would help keep interest.</td>', 'Composition is good with the diagonal line from eye to eye and the cheeks, Unfortunate too blurry. Also downloading a larger file would help keep interest.', '2004-01-30 22:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(563577, 57181, 15242, '<td valign="top">A cat is not a lion, the focus is off, and you have glowing eyes.  There is nothing good about this picture.  You need to try a little harder if you want to do well here.</td>', 'A cat is not a lion, the focus is off, and you have glowing eyes.  There is nothing good about this picture.  You need to try a little harder if you want to do well here.', '2004-01-30 22:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(563578, 57252, 10084, '<td valign="top">Interesting scene. All the details help to keep your interest. Don''t really like the orange hue that lights the composition. Correcting light balance would definitely help with this.</td>', 'Interesting scene. All the details help to keep your interest. Don''t really like the orange hue that lights the composition. Correcting light balance would definitely help with this.', '2004-01-30 22:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(563579, 57268, 10084, '<td valign="top">Good depth of field on the pewter bull. Nice details captured. The angle you capture helps to make it dynamic and seem to be in motion. Very good.</td>', 'Good depth of field on the pewter bull. Nice details captured. The angle you capture helps to make it dynamic and seem to be in motion. Very good.', '2004-01-30 22:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(563611, 57299, 9546, '<td valign="top">Awesome photo, one of my favorites</td>', 'Awesome photo, one of my favorites', '2004-01-30 23:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(563620, 57305, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, composition ok, I do not prefer the blurred look.</td>', 'Nice idea, composition ok, I do not prefer the blurred look.', '2004-01-30 23:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(563621, 57122, 6600, '<td valign="top">Very bright and colorful, good focus, nice job.</td>', 'Very bright and colorful, good focus, nice job.', '2004-01-30 23:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(563630, 57305, 15407, '<td valign="top">I like this pose  &amp; concept vy much but for me the soft focus distracted.</td>', 'I like this pose  & concept vy much but for me the soft focus distracted.', '2004-01-31 00:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(563633, 56811, 11078, '<td valign="top">Cute but a little blurred nice colour though</td>', 'Cute but a little blurred nice colour though', '2004-01-31 01:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
