(563669, 57297, 15407, '<td valign="top">I got a great laugh out of this one, which always garners an extra point when I feel that the theme has been acheived. The technical challenge of producing this shot directly into the sunlight  was done well also.</td>', 'I got a great laugh out of this one, which always garners an extra point when I feel that the theme has been acheived. The technical challenge of producing this shot directly into the sunlight  was done well also.', '2004-01-31 01:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
