(564215, 57095, 16676, '<td valign="top">Unimpressive choice for Taurus.  The lighting angle needs improvement.</td>', 'Unimpressive choice for Taurus.  The lighting angle needs improvement.', '2004-02-01 05:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(564231, 57203, 3540, '<td valign="top">I thought this was the best photo of the challenge.  NIce warm backlit with a good subject, excellent symmetry, well framed and well shot.  Nice work 9</td>', 'I thought this was the best photo of the challenge.  NIce warm backlit with a good subject, excellent symmetry, well framed and well shot.  Nice work 9', '2004-02-01 07:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(564232, 56668, 3540, '<td valign="top">This was one of my top 3 rated photos for this challenge.  I think its a bit of a stretch for the topic, but it is definitely one of the better taken photos.   Good symmetry, well lit and well shot. 8</td>', 'This was one of my top 3 rated photos for this challenge.  I think its a bit of a stretch for the topic, but it is definitely one of the better taken photos.   Good symmetry, well lit and well shot. 8', '2004-02-01 07:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(564234, 57218, 3540, '<td valign="top">This isn''t the best taken photo of the challenge.  It may however be the coolest.  Your idea is incredible.  Very well thought out.  If only the arrow could''ve been straighter.  Well framed and the lighting is pretty good too.  Excellent creative idea. good luck 8</td>', 'This isn''t the best taken photo of the challenge.  It may however be the coolest.  Your idea is incredible.  Very well thought out.  If only the arrow could''ve been straighter.  Well framed and the lighting is pretty good too.  Excellent creative idea. good luck 8', '2004-02-01 07:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(564236, 57150, 3540, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind this a lot. Personally I like this shot except for the framing.  I would''ve tried to make it portait oriented.  I think I''d have cut off almost all the black on the left side and a little on the right.  about enough to make her pretty centered.  Its a good shot.  One of my top 5 for the challenge.</td>', 'I like the idea behind this a lot. Personally I like this shot except for the framing.  I would''ve tried to make it portait oriented.  I think I''d have cut off almost all the black on the left side and a little on the right.  about enough to make her pretty centered.  Its a good shot.  One of my top 5 for the challenge.', '2004-02-01 07:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(564245, 57221, 16137, '<td valign="top">This grabbed my attention straight away. Very atmospheric</td>', 'This grabbed my attention straight away. Very atmospheric', '2004-02-01 08:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(564247, 57181, 16137, '<td valign="top">Sorry to offend,but this is awful!</td>', 'Sorry to offend,but this is awful!', '2004-02-01 08:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(564249, 56847, 16137, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2004-02-01 08:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(564297, 57265, 6306, '<td valign="top">He/she looks sad, with those drooping eyes. I like this one. 8</td>', 'He/she looks sad, with those drooping eyes. I like this one. 8', '2004-02-01 11:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(564299, 57307, 6306, '<td valign="top">This one reminds me of Finding Nemo. =) Very good detail in the eyes and the flesh. The white in the lower left is a bit distracting but overall, nice shot.</td>', 'This one reminds me of Finding Nemo. =) Very good detail in the eyes and the flesh. The white in the lower left is a bit distracting but overall, nice shot.', '2004-02-01 11:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(564302, 57218, 6306, '<td valign="top">This is a 10. Amazing. How did you create this image?</td>', 'This is a 10. Amazing. How did you create this image?', '2004-02-01 11:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(564303, 56711, 6306, '<td valign="top">This is cool. The arrow evokes a good sense of motion. 9</td>', 'This is cool. The arrow evokes a good sense of motion. 9', '2004-02-01 11:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(564304, 57031, 6306, '<td valign="top">A tripod or more light might have improved this image.  It is a bit too blurry, in my opinion.</td>', 'A tripod or more light might have improved this image.  It is a bit too blurry, in my opinion.', '2004-02-01 11:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(564305, 57078, 6306, '<td valign="top">Great detail in this shot.  The rope is a bit distracting, but it gives the sense of a "fresh catch".  8</td>', 'Great detail in this shot.  The rope is a bit distracting, but it gives the sense of a "fresh catch".  8', '2004-02-01 11:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(564309, 56722, 6306, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for black and white. This is beautiful. Nice depth of field and great detail. 10</td>', 'I''m a sucker for black and white. This is beautiful. Nice depth of field and great detail. 10', '2004-02-01 11:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(564310, 57272, 6306, '<td valign="top">Haha.  Those are some goofy looking lions.  I like this. 8</td>', 'Haha.  Those are some goofy looking lions.  I like this. 8', '2004-02-01 11:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(564312, 57203, 6306, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, the body should be illuminated. Otherwise this is a great shot. 8</td>', 'In my opinion, the body should be illuminated. Otherwise this is a great shot. 8', '2004-02-01 11:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(564313, 57218, 16230, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a nice image! The composition is great, and I like the background color and the way it shades into darkness. I think this would have done well in the "painting with light" challenge too. Very well done!</td>', 'Wow, what a nice image! The composition is great, and I like the background color and the way it shades into darkness. I think this would have done well in the "painting with light" challenge too. Very well done!', '2004-02-01 11:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(564318, 57251, 6306, '<td valign="top">Makes me want to take a portrait photography class. This is beautiful.  9</td>', 'Makes me want to take a portrait photography class. This is beautiful.  9', '2004-02-01 11:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(564320, 56229, 6306, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot with nice use of shadows. Try converting this to grayscale.  It would look beautiful.  8</td>', 'This is a nice shot with nice use of shadows. Try converting this to grayscale.  It would look beautiful.  8', '2004-02-01 11:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(564321, 57203, 16230, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Silhouetting the crab was a great idea, and you executed it very well. Cool photo!</td>', 'Very nice! Silhouetting the crab was a great idea, and you executed it very well. Cool photo!', '2004-02-01 11:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(564323, 57150, 6306, '<td valign="top">I wish this shot wasn''t so blurry.  It would be much nicer.  8</td>', 'I wish this shot wasn''t so blurry.  It would be much nicer.  8', '2004-02-01 11:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(564344, 57230, 16563, '<td valign="top">Uh, nice picture, but I don''t think crabs are a Chinese Zodiac Image. Great picture though.</td>', 'Uh, nice picture, but I don''t think crabs are a Chinese Zodiac Image. Great picture though.', '2004-02-01 12:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(564349, 57218, 14008, '<td valign="top">This looks like it took a lot of effort. well done.</td>', 'This looks like it took a lot of effort. well done.', '2004-02-01 12:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(564351, 57122, 14008, '<td valign="top">Maybe I would have given this 10, but the second fish from the left has too much black on it so it leaves an unpleasant ''gap'' in the image. Still really very good!</td>', 'Maybe I would have given this 10, but the second fish from the left has too much black on it so it leaves an unpleasant ''gap'' in the image. Still really very good!', '2004-02-01 12:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
