(564353, 57031, 14008, '<td valign="top">too much blur &amp; motion for me; and the one stationary fish isn''t enough contrast against background.  great concept though!</td>', 'too much blur & motion for me; and the one stationary fish isn''t enough contrast against background.  great concept though!', '2004-02-01 12:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
