(567458, 56668, 16052, '<td valign="top">Good concept but I believe that better lighting particularly in area between pieces would have made this pic strikingly better.  Focus also appears a bit weak.</td>', 'Good concept but I believe that better lighting particularly in area between pieces would have made this pic strikingly better.  Focus also appears a bit weak.', '2004-02-03 22:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
