(567464, 57304, 16052, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  I would have preferred that the lighting reflection not be visible though in the inside back of the picture.  This distracts from the beautiful illumination of the poured water that you have captured in this picture.</td>', 'Very nicely done.  I would have preferred that the lighting reflection not be visible though in the inside back of the picture.  This distracts from the beautiful illumination of the poured water that you have captured in this picture.', '2004-02-03 22:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
