(567472, 56459, 16052, '<td valign="top">If you would have just cropped out the lower half of this photo entirely and have Leo''s head facing out onto a vast blue empty sky this picture would have been more emotive.  Buildings on lower left are a distraction.</td>', 'If you would have just cropped out the lower half of this photo entirely and have Leo''s head facing out onto a vast blue empty sky this picture would have been more emotive.  Buildings on lower left are a distraction.', '2004-02-03 22:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
