(567478, 56927, 16052, '<td valign="top">Lighting and focus off.  If these both had been better i''d think your composition and picture would be right on the money.</td>', 'Lighting and focus off.  If these both had been better i''d think your composition and picture would be right on the money.', '2004-02-03 22:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
