(567482, 57306, 16052, '<td valign="top">Very captivating effect here.  Highly interesting.</td>', 'Very captivating effect here.  Highly interesting.', '2004-02-03 23:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(567486, 57078, 16052, '<td valign="top">Love the composition here.  Wish fish tail in foreground would have been better in focus.</td>', 'Love the composition here.  Wish fish tail in foreground would have been better in focus.', '2004-02-03 23:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(567490, 57217, 15330, '<td valign="top">The subject is interesting, but I think you could have tried a more interesting perspective to improve the photo, its just too ordinary right now. The lighting is a little harsh especially in the background which is blown out in the center. The two edges on the left, and the wall are a little distracting.</td>', 'The subject is interesting, but I think you could have tried a more interesting perspective to improve the photo, its just too ordinary right now. The lighting is a little harsh especially in the background which is blown out in the center. The two edges on the left, and the wall are a little distracting.', '2004-02-03 23:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(567496, 57203, 16052, '<td valign="top">Very Nicely Done. Only very slightly flawed in my book by nit being perfectly straight in frame. 9.</td>', 'Very Nicely Done. Only very slightly flawed in my book by nit being perfectly straight in frame. 9.', '2004-02-03 23:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(567497, 57279, 15330, '<td valign="top">For some reason that water doesn''t look like water. Il ike the nice blue lighting, and how it fades into black as it gets closer to the edges.</td>', 'For some reason that water doesn''t look like water. Il ike the nice blue lighting, and how it fades into black as it gets closer to the edges.', '2004-02-03 23:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(567503, 57184, 16052, '<td valign="top">White background on left is taking away from this photograph.  Much better if composition had been allowed to have moe uniformly black ground on upper half of photo.</td>', 'White background on left is taking away from this photograph.  Much better if composition had been allowed to have moe uniformly black ground on upper half of photo.', '2004-02-03 23:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(567504, 57110, 15330, '<td valign="top">The background is a little distracting. The red candel seems to blend into the background since its the same color, I think a more definite edge would be better there.</td>', 'The background is a little distracting. The red candel seems to blend into the background since its the same color, I think a more definite edge would be better there.', '2004-02-03 23:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(567509, 57123, 16052, '<td valign="top">Foreground vegetation out of focus takes away from overall composition.  I love the extremely interesting background and all the clearly focused detailed elements...peebles, earth, flora.  Just get rid of that blurred object in the foreground.</td>', 'Foreground vegetation out of focus takes away from overall composition.  I love the extremely interesting background and all the clearly focused detailed elements...peebles, earth, flora.  Just get rid of that blurred object in the foreground.', '2004-02-03 23:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(567518, 57189, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, DOF is about perfect, good color.  Nice job!</td>', 'Nice composition, DOF is about perfect, good color.  Nice job!', '2004-02-03 23:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(567524, 56780, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice softness and exposure.  Critique: To much of the subject is being hidden, gives me a cheated feeling.  Top left corner got missed (picky, picky, I know).  Great vase.</td>', 'Nice softness and exposure.  Critique: To much of the subject is being hidden, gives me a cheated feeling.  Top left corner got missed (picky, picky, I know).  Great vase.', '2004-02-03 23:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(567526, 56847, 6600, '<td valign="top">Very busy photo - a real focal point in the photo excapes me.  Abstract feel.</td>', 'Very busy photo - a real focal point in the photo excapes me.  Abstract feel.', '2004-02-03 23:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(567531, 57272, 6600, '<td valign="top">Good color and exposure, composition is good.  It would have been nice (if possible) to have made the background blurred via. shallow DOF - the detailed background takes away from the lions (the subject).  Nice photo though.</td>', 'Good color and exposure, composition is good.  It would have been nice (if possible) to have made the background blurred via. shallow DOF - the detailed background takes away from the lions (the subject).  Nice photo though.', '2004-02-03 23:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(567541, 56468, 12160, '<td valign="top">I somehow fail to get the connection to zodiac signs. An explanation might help. Thanks. - upping the vote to 7 for photo quality. nice composition and beautiful color tone.</td>', 'I somehow fail to get the connection to zodiac signs. An explanation might help. Thanks. - upping the vote to 7 for photo quality. nice composition and beautiful color tone.', '2004-02-03 23:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(567552, 57221, 1717, '<td valign="top">this was my fav...should have placed MUCH higher!  great pic, G.</td>', 'this was my fav...should have placed MUCH higher!  great pic, G.', '2004-02-04 00:03:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(567553, 57261, 772, '<td valign="top">This is excellent work.. congrats on a great finish :)</td>', 'This is excellent work.. congrats on a great finish :)', '2004-02-04 00:04:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(567564, 56711, 3419, '<td valign="top">Love it, love it, love it. I''m a 3D archer myself, and just love it. And it''s been achieved by a fellow S602 Zoom user too!</td>', 'Love it, love it, love it. I''m a 3D archer myself, and just love it. And it''s been achieved by a fellow S602 Zoom user too!', '2004-02-04 00:13:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(567565, 56575, 12332, '<td valign="top">Thanks for (almost) all the comments!!  I did mess up here - the upper right-hand corner, there''s a wrinkle in the wax paper I used for a backdrop.  I didn''t see it until I had everything broken down and I was chosing the photo to edit - with only an hour left to go.  The wrinkle got progressively worse to the right and up, so I cropped really tight!<br/> <br/>Also, when taking the photo, I didn''t notice how distracting the woodgrain was.  That was the reason I darkened the red channel - it actually de-emphasized it best.  But not good enough - next time - plain cloth for the floor!<br/> <br/>Playing with the florescent hand-light, I liked this angle best, even though it didn''t emphasize the eyes.  The eyes on this particular "sculpture" are really plain, anyhow - not much there more than you can see in this pic.  The rippling muscles are the thing for this Leo.  And I really liked the shadow of the tooth on the back of his mouth.<br/> <br/>Again, sincere thanks for your comments!!</td>', 'Thanks for (almost) all the comments!!  I did mess up here - the upper right-hand corner, there''s a wrinkle in the wax paper I used for a backdrop.  I didn''t see it until I had everything broken down and I was chosing the photo to edit - with only an hour left to go.  The wrinkle got progressively worse to the right and up, so I cropped really tight! Also, when taking the photo, I didn''t notice how distracting the woodgrain was.  That was the reason I darkened the red channel - it actually de-emphasized it best.  But not good enough - next time - plain cloth for the floor! Playing with the florescent hand-light, I liked this angle best, even though it didn''t emphasize the eyes.  The eyes on this particular "sculpture" are really plain, anyhow - not much there more than you can see in this pic.  The rippling muscles are the thing for this Leo.  And I really liked the shadow of the tooth on the back of his mouth. Again, sincere thanks for your comments!!', '2004-02-04 00:15:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(567571, 56668, 15330, '<td valign="top">I agree with all of you on the shadow, I actually didn''t use any light s for this photo. I just took it next to a window. I couldn''t get rid of the grain since neat image isn''t alowed in this challenge. I did try neat image, and it did helpe a lot, gave the photo soft focus, and got rid of almost all of the grain. <br/> <br/>Thanks everybody for comenting, and critiquing.</td>', 'I agree with all of you on the shadow, I actually didn''t use any light s for this photo. I just took it next to a window. I couldn''t get rid of the grain since neat image isn''t alowed in this challenge. I did try neat image, and it did helpe a lot, gave the photo soft focus, and got rid of almost all of the grain.  Thanks everybody for comenting, and critiquing.', '2004-02-04 00:20:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(567578, 57251, 1647, '<td valign="top">As others have said - this shot is perhaps a fraction overexposed but what a lovely dreamy shot.  The lighting behind her creating the glow and the dreamy soft-focus effect are great.  It''s a really good example of soft-focus making sense.<br/> <br/>The beautiful skin and soft flowing hair really create an angelic effect as well.  I really must try some portrait photography myself.</td>', 'As others have said - this shot is perhaps a fraction overexposed but what a lovely dreamy shot.  The lighting behind her creating the glow and the dreamy soft-focus effect are great.  It''s a really good example of soft-focus making sense. The beautiful skin and soft flowing hair really create an angelic effect as well.  I really must try some portrait photography myself.', '2004-02-04 00:22:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(567579, 57251, 11078, '<td valign="top">I am very surprised this didnt do better I really like this</td>', 'I am very surprised this didnt do better I really like this', '2004-02-04 00:22:17.000000', NULL, 0),
