(568611, 57218, 16188, '<td valign="top">I think it''s just perfect as is.  The mood is fantastic, the concept wonderful and beautifully executed, the image is stellar.  I personally don''t like photographs to be ''fixed'' too much - the spots on the wall add to the texture of the shot, why remove them?  Anyway, congratulations on your blue ribbon. :)</td>', 'I think it''s just perfect as is.  The mood is fantastic, the concept wonderful and beautifully executed, the image is stellar.  I personally don''t like photographs to be ''fixed'' too much - the spots on the wall add to the texture of the shot, why remove them?  Anyway, congratulations on your blue ribbon. :)', '2004-02-04 13:41:50.000000', NULL, 0),
