(568738, 57218, 9780, '<td valign="top">I think this is my first time I have said "YESS! she won" for a picture that I didn''t made. ewery thing about here is perfect.... thoug she is litle shaky and dark, IMO that is what make the picture so good: Well done!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-02-04 15:32:36.</i></td>', 'I think this is my first time I have said "YESS! she won" for a picture that I didn''t made. ewery thing about here is perfect.... thoug she is litle shaky and dark, IMO that is what make the picture so good: Well done!', '2004-02-04 15:29:57.000000', '2004-02-04 15:32:36.000000', 0),
