(569047, 57159, 280, '<td valign="top">I liked this shot and thought it may have done better than it did. There are two things that I dont like, first of all I found the watch on the models wrist quite distrating. Maybe beacuse it was on a horizontal third my eye was drawn towards it? Secondly the uneven border, I know it''s a little bit picky, but I think photographs look better on this site when presented in an even border. <br/>However a great creative and fun photograph, I look forward to seeing more of your work.<br/> <br/>Tom<br/></td>', 'I liked this shot and thought it may have done better than it did. There are two things that I dont like, first of all I found the watch on the models wrist quite distrating. Maybe beacuse it was on a horizontal third my eye was drawn towards it? Secondly the uneven border, I know it''s a little bit picky, but I think photographs look better on this site when presented in an even border. However a great creative and fun photograph, I look forward to seeing more of your work. Tom', '2004-02-04 20:11:31.000000', NULL, 0),
