(569325, 57282, 13669, '<td valign="top">True indeed, 111 seems quite harsh, I personally loved the photo, thought it was very creative, much more than my own submission, but I guess that is what is great about photography, so many different interpretation on the same image.  Either way, nicely done.<br/> <br/>Whiskey</td>', 'True indeed, 111 seems quite harsh, I personally loved the photo, thought it was very creative, much more than my own submission, but I guess that is what is great about photography, so many different interpretation on the same image.  Either way, nicely done. Whiskey', '2004-02-04 23:45:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(569347, 57251, 10084, '<td valign="top">Gave you a "10" on this one. Thought that you were going to get a much higher score. I think this shot should be considered your best shot ever.The lighting is awesome. Soft lighting works perfectly.<br/> <br/>This is a photography resume shot. Take some more like this go to her school and become the new school portrait photographer. It''s that good. <br/> <br/>School pictures can be very expensive. You could be an option for the students that can''t afford the school ones. Plus you can probably deduct taxes for all the props and gear.</td>', 'Gave you a "10" on this one. Thought that you were going to get a much higher score. I think this shot should be considered your best shot ever.The lighting is awesome. Soft lighting works perfectly. This is a photography resume shot. Take some more like this go to her school and become the new school portrait photographer. It''s that good.  School pictures can be very expensive. You could be an option for the students that can''t afford the school ones. Plus you can probably deduct taxes for all the props and gear.', '2004-02-05 00:13:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(569503, 57083, 14008, '<td valign="top">Grundle, got your msg and ok now I get it.  I think you were assuming too much from your audience! :-)  I didn''t think it was a bad picture but couldn''t see the link.  Just one tiny improvement to the pic itself - the ''background'' (bed cover?) doesn''t quite make the top right corner.  If I''d understood it would have been a bit more generous with my score.  Good luck next time,</td>', 'Grundle, got your msg and ok now I get it.  I think you were assuming too much from your audience! :-)  I didn''t think it was a bad picture but couldn''t see the link.  Just one tiny improvement to the pic itself - the ''background'' (bed cover?) doesn''t quite make the top right corner.  If I''d understood it would have been a bit more generous with my score.  Good luck next time,', '2004-02-05 04:14:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(569645, 57218, 714, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  You worked hard on this and deserve the ribbon! Congrats.</td>', 'Nice shot.  You worked hard on this and deserve the ribbon! Congrats.', '2004-02-05 08:08:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(569864, 57058, 9763, '<td valign="top">I had submitted this photo before there was even a "Chinese Zodiac" challenge.  So, originally, I thought I was just being creative, and stretching the challenge title: Zodiac.  <br/> <br/>However, it backfired on me as soon as the CZ challenge was added.  Sadly, I didn''t notice until after it was too late to unsubmit.  Oh well, thanks for commenting and voting.  <br/> <br/>Thank those especially who left some constructive criticism about the photograph itself, helping me become a better photographer!</td>', 'I had submitted this photo before there was even a "Chinese Zodiac" challenge.  So, originally, I thought I was just being creative, and stretching the challenge title: Zodiac.   However, it backfired on me as soon as the CZ challenge was added.  Sadly, I didn''t notice until after it was too late to unsubmit.  Oh well, thanks for commenting and voting.   Thank those especially who left some constructive criticism about the photograph itself, helping me become a better photographer!', '2004-02-05 12:12:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(570051, 57218, 2221, '<td valign="top">I congratulate you to this great photograph my brother! I like special lighting tricks very much and this is clever idea. I think this photo really is one of your best!</td>', 'I congratulate you to this great photograph my brother! I like special lighting tricks very much and this is clever idea. I think this photo really is one of your best!', '2004-02-05 15:38:44.000000', NULL, 0),
