(571307, 57123, 5792, '<td valign="top">This image would have done better if the shaft of the arrow had been positioned to come from one of the corners.<br/> <br/>For example, the shaft of the arrow could come from the upper right corner and the arrowhead itself made to be centered on the lower left intersection point of the ROT horizontal and vertical lines.</td>', 'This image would have done better if the shaft of the arrow had been positioned to come from one of the corners. For example, the shaft of the arrow could come from the upper right corner and the arrowhead itself made to be centered on the lower left intersection point of the ROT horizontal and vertical lines.', '2004-02-06 18:37:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(571636, 56726, 259, '<td valign="top">people here are way too worried about grain.  there is a huge difference between grain/noise that takes away from a picture and grain used to enhance.  i like your picture the way it is.</td>', 'people here are way too worried about grain.  there is a huge difference between grain/noise that takes away from a picture and grain used to enhance.  i like your picture the way it is.', '2004-02-07 02:47:01.000000', NULL, 0),
