(574734, 56587, 14401, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the critique club!  I missed this one when looking through the Zodiac challenge - first impression, I like it very much.  Looking a little closer, I have to agree with many of your commenters - the shadow of the back twin is really needs to go.  I''m thinking that a little bit of backlighting (just off to the side) and behind the back figure might have eliminated the shadow and allowed for a little more sharpness for that figure as well.  Overall, I think the exposure was very well done (better than most of my indoor shots!) and I''m surprised that this didn''t do better!</td>', 'Greetings from the critique club!  I missed this one when looking through the Zodiac challenge - first impression, I like it very much.  Looking a little closer, I have to agree with many of your commenters - the shadow of the back twin is really needs to go.  I''m thinking that a little bit of backlighting (just off to the side) and behind the back figure might have eliminated the shadow and allowed for a little more sharpness for that figure as well.  Overall, I think the exposure was very well done (better than most of my indoor shots!) and I''m surprised that this didn''t do better!', '2004-02-10 15:55:59.000000', NULL, 0),
