(1072279, 57203, 22734, '<td valign="top">What a golden beauty to illuminate the Zodiac. The crab was selected because of its bacward side movement which resembles the apparant path of the Sun. At this time. in the western hemisphere, it almost reaches a dead stop and then begins its journey in the other direction. Hence, the longest day of the year. Your image is very impressionable.</td>', 'What a golden beauty to illuminate the Zodiac. The crab was selected because of its bacward side movement which resembles the apparant path of the Sun. At this time. in the western hemisphere, it almost reaches a dead stop and then begins its journey in the other direction. Hence, the longest day of the year. Your image is very impressionable.', '2004-12-21 15:42:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(1402192, 57230, 37961, '<td valign="top">Being a Cancer myself I must say this caught my attention.<br/> <br/>Very interesting choice of colors/subjects. Love it.</td>', 'Being a Cancer myself I must say this caught my attention. Very interesting choice of colors/subjects. Love it.', '2005-05-21 10:00:13.000000', NULL, 0),
